(261, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'DHTHM1.FDS', 1206.00, 112.00, 0.00, 120, 'Av. Coba & Carr. Tulum ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77780', '23', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2023, 18, '', NULL, 'Fully Furnished and Equipped Condo. Ground Floor', 'Elegantly styled 2BR Condo with a private garden in an ecological environment\r\n\r\nThis project focuses on maintaining and preserving the native trees that fill Tulum, leaving the condos with a  unique jungle environment. \r\n\r\nThese condos all have a private terrace and are fully furnished, equipped, and decorated. \r\n\r\nThe amenities include: \r\n- An organic garden\r\n- Hammock area,\r\n-Pathway of murals\r\n- Parking\r\n- Gym\r\n- Pool\r\n- Grill area\r\n- Restaurant and bar\r\n- 24/7 security\r\n-Concierge\r\n- Free transportation to Ziggy\'s beach club\r\n- Condo-hotel service\r\n-Vacation rental program', '-87.44989110302598', '20.20741329059194', 1, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(185, 'active', '', 18, 20, 64, 'SA04MS', 1900.00, 176.00, 0.00, 0, 'Aldea Zama ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77780', '23', 4, 4, 0, 0, 0, 2015, 18, '', NULL, 'Delightful Home Near the Main Attractions of Tulum', 'Great home located near the main attractions of Tulum in a growing area.\r\nEach master bedroom has ample closet space, ceiling fans, and AC. \r\nAlong with this, it has the perfect amenities:\r\n- Secure parking\r\n- A beautifully landscaped backyard\r\n- A private pool\r\n- A garden\r\n- A Bbq Area ', '-87.458037', '20.198171', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(419, 'sold', 'SOLD', 18, 20, 61, 'ARCT.MS', 1251.00, 116.00, 0.00, 0, 'Bahia Xaak', '', '2455', '23', '105', '77733', '182', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2010, 13, '', NULL, 'Beautiful 2BR Condo Furnished, Equipped and Decorated !! ', 'Live your retirement in one of the most exclusive and safe places in Quintana Roo: Puerto Aventuras, a private gated community \r\n\r\nThis condo located in Bahia Xaac, it is on the third floor in the left corner overlooking the shared areas, with no neighbor\'s eyesight. \r\n\r\nIt has an elevator, a big shared pool with beach chairs to spend your days relaxed. \r\n\r\n5 minutes walking to the beach and golf course.', '-87.22205795126732', '20.50535524077911', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(104, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'GM-HT-01-V', 395.00, 36.70, 0.00, 144, 'Calle Neptuno ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '208', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 0, '', NULL, 'An Ambitious Project In Tulum That Attracts Attention!', 'An ambitious project in Tulum that attracts attention!\r\n\r\nA natural combination of colonial architecture, lush tropical vegetation with swimming pools and lagoons, and unique first-class amenities:\r\nâ€¢	Sunset View Library\r\nâ€¢	Zen Deck\r\nâ€¢	Observation Deck (Telescopes + Pool + Pebbler + Grill)\r\nâ€¢	Solarium Deck (Pool + Bar)\r\nâ€¢	Dog Park\r\nâ€¢	Kids Club\r\nâ€¢	Underground parking\r\nâ€¢	24/7 Security\r\nâ€¢	Restaurant\r\nâ€¢	Personalized Concierge\r\n\r\nAll units are furnished, delivered with high-quality finishes, and feature spacious private terraces.', '-87.44915490015944', '20.210414596335973', 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(417, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 0, 'JOHKPDC.AM', 1604.00, 149.00, 0.00, 0, '39 cerrada chichentra M21 LT 1 Pakaal', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77717', '1', 3, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2002, 13, '', NULL, 'Gorgeous 3 Bedroom Condo In Playacar', 'This lovely 3 bedroom condo located in the gated community of Playa Car. It is near the beautiful golf course and its amenities include:\r\n\r\n- Breakfast Nook\r\n- Swimming Pool \r\n- Garden Area ', '-87.0848475', '20.6134332', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(418, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 63, 'AROZ.MS', 1776.00, 165.00, 0.00, 0, 'Calle 12 Nte, Entre Avenidas 10 y 15 ', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '5', 7, 7, 0, 0, 0, 2019, 18, '', NULL, '7 BR Townhouse with Ocean View Located on the 5th avenue', 'This gorgeous 3-story Townhouse located on the 5th avenue of Playa Del Carmen offers a panoramic view of the ocean from the rooftop.\r\n\r\nIts high ceilings, large windows, big wooden doors, and 3 balconies allow for ample light and freshness. \r\n\r\nThis newly built townhouse is located 4 blocks from the entrance of the Cortisol Residential areas and is very close to Playa Esmeralda and a Cenote. \r\n\r\nWith double garage. ', '-87.07282580467879', '20.628213967226714', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(729, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, '', 710.40, 66.10, 0.00, 0, 'Av. Coba', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '208', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 18, '', NULL, 'Last Chance for Summer Discount â€“ Available in September: $30,000 USD Off! Swim-Up Loft at Xalet Tulum', 'Fully furnished and equipped, this property is ready to move in or start renting out. Currently operating as an Airbnb, it has great potential.\r\n\r\nThis two-level condo has everything you need: modern style, high-end appliances, first-class amenities, and a prime location.\r\n\r\nXalet Tulum is an exclusive gated development located in one of Tulumâ€™s most sought-after areas, with direct access to Av. CobÃ¡â€”the main road connecting downtown Tulum to the beach. CafÃ©s, Chedraui Select, public transportation, and more are within walking distance.\r\n\r\nThe project offers an exceptional variety of amenities:\r\nâ€¢ Access to a beach club\r\nâ€¢ Rooftop infinity pool, swim-up pool, and jacuzzi\r\nâ€¢ Yoga deck, zen garden, spa, and wellness center\r\nâ€¢ Gym, spinning room, reading lounge, and snack bar\r\nâ€¢ Rooftop lounge with fire pits\r\nâ€¢ Eco-friendly design with solar panels, rainwater collection system, and more\r\nâ€¢ Concierge service, 24/7 security\r\n\r\nContact us for more information!', '', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'loft', ''),
(183, 'active', '', 18, 20, 64, 'DHBPAA.AM', 3014.00, 280.00, 4876.00, 0, 'Carretera Tulum.Cancun, Bahia Principe', '', '2444', '23', '85', '77737', '152', 3, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 21, '', NULL, 'Modern 3BR House Located in Bahia Principe', 'This modern 3 bedrooms 3 bathroom home located in Bahia Principe is filled with beautiful architecture and style. \r\nSpacious with a private terrace, a lounge area, a patio and, a balcony. \r\n\r\nAs an owner, you will enjoy the benefits and special discount from the Bahia Principe Deluxe Resort: \r\n- 15 restaurants\r\n- 7 buffets\r\n- 21 bars\r\n- 4 gyms\r\n- 2 golf courses\r\n- 5 pools\r\n-Several sports areas\r\n- Several Spas\r\n- Casino\r\n- Clubs ', '-87.315901', '20.373431', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 453.00, 'bed', 'Released 18 months after purchase'),
(259, 'sold', 'Local Lifestyle', 18, 20, 64, 'SAPDCBAM2.FDS', 4520.00, 420.00, 3445.00, 0, 'Bambu Residencial', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '139', 5, 5, 1, 0, 0, 2019, 18, '', NULL, 'Beautiful And Spacious Home In an Increasing Area !! ', 'This beautiful house is located in Playa del Carmen, an idyllic place in the heart of the Riviera Maya with fine white sand and turquoise waters.\r\n\r\nPositioned as one of the best zone in the city: the Diamante zone. \r\n\r\nIn this area, the economy and property values are growing very rapidly, making it the ideal place to invest! \r\n\r\nThis home is spacious with a good luminosity and has a jacuzzi in the bathroom. \r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\n- A common pool\r\n- Playground for kids\r\n-  24/7 security\r\n- Garage for 3 cars', '-87.0792092639246', '20.63906839215525', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 320.00, 'bed', ''),
(260, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 63, 'GPTULBHA1.FDS', 1700.00, 158.00, 0.00, 100, 'Bahia Principe Gran Maya Mza 22 Lote1', '', '2444', '23', '85', '77776', '152', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 21, '', NULL, 'Amazing Opportunity To Invest Near From Bahia Principe Deluxe Resort - Townhouse 2BR', 'This project is located within the Bahia Principe resort and residential complex, allowing you to enjoy their world-renowned services and amenities : \r\n- 15 restaurants and 7 buffets \r\n- 21 bars \r\n- 2 golf courses \r\n- 4 gym and Spa \r\n- 5 pools \r\n- Casino \r\n- Free transportation to the complex with benefits and discounts for all the activities !!\r\n\r\nEach and every space, including common areas and access, has been meticulously designed to live in harmony with Nature.\r\nYou can enjoy other amenities inside your condominium: 2 pools, rooftop, bbq area, laundry room, elevator, parking, concierge, and security 24/7. ', '-87.332931', '20.384570', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(74, 'active', 'Oceanfront', 18, 20, 61, ' GM-IT-01-V', 1184.00, 110.00, 0.00, 25, 'Av. CTM & Calle Albatros', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '10', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 0, '', NULL, 'Luxury Oceanfront 2-Bedroom Condo With Private Pool', 'Located in Calle Albatros and Calle Pelicanos, in the north zone of Playa del Carmen, this oceanfront residential development surrounded by nice restaurants, bars and shops.\r\nThe project consists of only 25 condos.\r\nAll unites have an ocean view, private pools and delivered fully furnished.\r\nThis area famous for its easy access to the white sand and walking distance to the famous Fifth Avenue.\r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢	Private pool on terraces\r\nâ€¢	Common pool with Sun Deck\r\nâ€¢	Spa\r\nâ€¢	Beach club\r\nâ€¢	Gym\r\nâ€¢	Restaurant\r\nâ€¢	Direct access to the Caribbean Sea\r\nâ€¢	Hotel services\r\nâ€¢	Elevators\r\n', '-87.060858', '20.635290', 1, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(75, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 64, 'GPPDCPM.AM', 4736.00, 440.00, 0.00, 0, 'Playa Magna, Playa Del Carmen,  Quintana Roo ', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77726', '110', 3, 3, 0, 0, 0, 2015, 18, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F3_dM6wkhzE&t=9s', NULL, 'Modern 3 BR House in Playa Del Carmen', 'Splendid house located in one of the most exclusive areas of Playa del Carmen. \r\n\r\nPlaya Magna is a luxury residential complex, with the best security 24 hours a day: Qualified personnel, access pens with electronic cards, closed circuit, and perimeter electrified fence.\r\n\r\n It has a lovely common area with : \r\n-  a clubhouse\r\n- a pool\r\n- a bbq area \r\n- playground\r\n- a pet area\r\n- cycle track \r\n', '-87.093165', '20.615496', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(730, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'NTS2-V', 570.00, 53.00, 0.00, 0, 'Av. Kukulkan ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '230', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'Turnkey Studio for Sale in Nook Tulum â€“ Ready to Use!', 'This spacious 53â€¯mÂ² studio is offered fully furnished and equipped, ideal for immediate use or investment. It features panoramic windows with views of green areas and complex amenities, a private 8â€¯mÂ² balcony, a king-size bed, TV, ample closet space, and a fully equipped kitchenâ€”everything you need to live or rent comfortably in Tulum.\r\n\r\nNook Tulum is a boutique development in Region 8 set within 7,500â€¯mÂ² of preserved jungle. The complex hosts just 78 units, offering a peaceful and exclusive atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAmenities include:\r\nâ€¢ Swimming pool, jacuzzi, bar, and green areas\r\nâ€¢ Security\r\nâ€¢ Coworking area with Starlink internet\r\n\r\nThe complex is conveniently located just a 5-minute bike ride from the beach.\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information or to schedule a viewing!', '-87.458349', '20.174463', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
(734, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'CMKLM-1-V', 688.80, 64.00, 0.00, 0, 'Calle Diagonal 85 Sur ', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '231', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2025, 18, '', NULL, 'Modern, Low-Density Community in Playa del Carmen. ', 'Discover this modern, low-density residential community offering comfort and style in one of the most sought-after areas of Playa del Carmen.\r\n\r\nThis growing neighborhood provides great convenience with easy access to shopping, dining, entertainment, and essential services. It is well-connected, close to the beach and downtown, offering the perfect balance between urban living and coastal relaxation.\r\n\r\nThe project features only 39 units across 9 towers, providing privacy and a peaceful atmosphereâ€”ideal for living, vacationing, or investingâ€”spread over more than 3,000 mÂ² of land.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nâ€¢ Modern design with spacious layouts\r\nâ€¢ Amenities: rooftop infinity pool, lounge, cinema, yoga & meditation area; ground-floor pool, gym, spa, coworking space, laundry, and more\r\nâ€¢ Underground utilities and secure access\r\nâ€¢ 1, 2, and 3-bedroom units, including lock-off and penthouse options\r\nâ€¢ Delivery scheduled for December 2025\r\nâ€¢ Bank financing available\r\n\r\nPerfect for living or generating rental income in one of Playaâ€™s fastest-growing neighborhoods.\r\nContact us for availability and details!\r\n\r\nNote: The original price is in Mexican pesos â€“ 2,953,500. The price in USD may vary depending on the current exchange rate.', '-87.098795', '20.622406', 1, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(733, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'SCK1', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'Av. Fundadores de Tulum', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'Stylish 2-Bedroom Lock-Off Condo in Sky Condos â€“ La Veleta, Tulum.', 'Welcome to your tranquil jungle retreat in the heart of La Veleta. This beautifully decorated 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom condo is located in Sky Condos, a boutique development known for its elegant design and excellent amenities. The spacious unit features a private balcony with a jacuzzi and a lock-off layout â€” perfect for generating rental income or enjoying as a private residence, offering both flexibility and privacy. Fully furnished and equipped, the condo is enhanced by charming artistic touches and stylish dÃ©cor that create a warm, inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAmenities include:\r\nâ€¢ Rooftop with infinity pool, bar, lounge area, and outdoor cinema\r\nâ€¢ Gym with yoga space\r\nâ€¢ Laundry facilities\r\nâ€¢ Coworking space\r\nâ€¢ Security and street parking in front of the complex\r\n\r\nSet on a quiet street with no nearby construction.\r\nWalking distance to the Holistika wellness center.\r\nEasy access to Calle 7, home to some of Tulumâ€™s best cafes and restaurants.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re seeking a full-time residence, a vacation getaway, or a high-performing rental property, this unit is a rare find in one of Tulumâ€™s most desirable neighborhoods.', '-87.477998', '20.197817', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(79, 'sold', 'Brand New', 18, 20, 62, 'GM-BT-03-V', 710.00, 66.00, 0.00, 95, 'Av. CTM & Calle Cozumel', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '10', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 0, '', NULL, 'Perfectly Situated In The Heart Of Playa del Carmen', 'A Must See! Exclusive Complex â€œThe Boatâ€ offers beautiful Penthouse for sale.\r\n\r\nThe unique design of this project attracts attention.\r\nThe monumental anchor as a sculptural element in the lobby to hold rooftop with swimming pool in the shape of a boat that connects both towers - complement the experience of once you are reaching the boatâ€™s deck, enjoying the Caribbean from the top.\r\nLocated in Coco Beach\'s residential area, just 2 blocks from the beach and few minutes from the famous 5th Avenue, where you will find a wide range of restaurants, shops, and bars.\r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢	A Rooftop Swimming Pool with plexiglass front\r\nâ€¢	Rooftop Restaurant\r\nâ€¢	Outdoor Rooftop cinema\r\nâ€¢	Snack Bar\r\nâ€¢	Sky lounge with stone Fire Pit\r\nâ€¢	Gym\r\nâ€¢	Solarium\r\nâ€¢	Underground parking\r\nâ€¢	Hotel services\r\nâ€¢	Commercial spaces for lease/rent\r\n\r\nLast units available.\r\n', '-87.061972', '20.636591', 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
