(83, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 62, 'DHTNKP.AM', 2475.00, 230.00, 0.00, 16, 'Calle Nak Be, Tulum, Aldea Zama', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77780', '23', 3, 3, 1, 0, 0, 2020, 13, '', NULL, '3BR Penthouse in Aldea Zama | Ask Us About Financing Option', 'Beautiful 3 Bedroom 4 Bathroom Penthouse in Tulum comes with a cellar, laundry room, balcony, terrace, rooftop, and jacuzzi.\r\n\r\nIn Aldea Zama, this new development is full of nature, privacy and is inspired by mystical Mayan architecture. \r\n\r\nAmenities: \r\nâ€¢	Large swimming pool for common area\r\nâ€¢	2 Jacuzzis in the common rooftop area\r\nâ€¢	Grill space in the common rooftop area\r\nâ€¢	Parking space for each unit\r\nâ€¢	Private storage for each unit', '-87.461124', '20.202798', 0, 0, 0, 0, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
