(188, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'GPGP', 1560.00, 145.00, 0.00, 0, 'Zazil Ha', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '17', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2015, 18, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uug7nKhW8Nk', NULL, 'Beautiful Pent Garden a Few Steps to the Beach', 'Exclusive Pentgarden Located 2 blocks from 5th Avenue and 2 blocks from the Sea of Playa del Carmen!\r\nDistributed in an open space that integrates living and dining room with the large kitchen equipped and accented with granite bar. The imported marble floors make it very fresh and elegant.\r\n\r\nIt has 2 bedrooms. The master bedroom has a king-size bed with a walk-in closet and bathroom. The second bedroom has two double beds and a separate bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe condo has: \r\n- A pool\r\n-An elevator\r\n-A Roof Garden with a pool, solarium, and an ocean view.\r\n\r\nAnother attraction for investors is that vacation rentals are authorized, resulting in a quick return on investment by renting a minimum of 180 USD per night in the low season and an average of 300 USD in the high season. So you put your money to work while you\'re not occupying it.', '-87.063925', '20.633245', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(85, 'sold', 'Modern', 18, 20, 0, 'DHBPAA.AM', 3020.00, 281.00, 0.00, 0, 'Bahia Principe', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77737', '108', 3, 3, 3, 0, 0, 2021, 0, '', NULL, 'Pre-Sale of Modern 3 BR Home in Bahia Principe ', 'This modern 3 bedrooms 3 bathroom home located in Bahia Principe is filled with beautiful architecture and style. This home comes with a 2 car garage attached to the home, a laundry room, a private swimming pool, and a private terrace. Bahia Principe is an amazing area packed with things to do. There are 15 restaurants, 7 buffets, 21 bars, 4 gyms, 2 golf courses, 5 pools, several sports areas, spas, a casino, and clubs. ', '-87.341169', '20.373431', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(86, 'sold', 'Soon Delivery', 19, 20, 61, 'DHTMT3.AM', 2023.00, 188.00, 0.00, 69, 'Av. Coba & Carr. Tulum ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77780', '108', 3, 3, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 18, '', NULL, 'Soon Delivery. Contemporary Designed 3-Bedroom Penthouse Surrounded by Nature', 'This contemporary designed 3 bedroom penthouse  5 minutes from the beach combines both luxury and comfort while preserving the nature surrounding it. \r\n\r\nEach condo has its own private terraces, is fully furnished, equipped, and decorated. \r\n\r\nIts amenities include a bar, a boutique cafe, a spa, a yoga center, a gym, a rooftop with a pool, parking, a laundry area, a concierge, 24/7 Security, a vacation rental program, condo-hotel service, and catering and room service.\r\n\r\n', '-87.451583', '20.203986', 0, 0, 0, 0, 7, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(87, 'sold', 'SOLD OUT', 18, 20, 61, 'GPPDCAWA1.FDS', 988.00, 91.00, 0.00, 230, 'Paseo Xaman Ha, Playacar Phase II ', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77717', '1', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 13, '', NULL, 'Magical Place for this 1BR Condo inside the Gated Community of PlayaCar', 'Playa Del Carmen, a place that until a few years ago was a small fishing village.\r\n\r\nCurrently, Playa Del Carmen has become a cosmopolitan paradise that attracts thousands of foreigners of all nationalities year after year and this multicultural mix has given life to a place with a unique lifestyle, making it one of the cities with the highest growth in Mexico. \r\nThis project situated in the luxury zone \"Playacar\" is a high-end residential project, this fractionation has access to a prehispanic area that has been preserved both by time and by its inhabitants, in addition to the incredible Xaman HÃ¡ aviary that surprises with the diversity of its exotic fauna. \r\n\r\nThe amenities of this development are designed in their entirety to make your day to day unique and satisfying experience:\r\n\r\n- A incredible pool of 535 feet,\r\n- Hammock area\r\n- Beach club\r\n-Kids area\r\n-Golf course\r\n-Fitness center\r\n-Yoga area\r\n-Spa\r\n-Lobby with concierge\r\n-Security 24/7\r\n\r\nJust a few steps from the beach, shopping centers, restaurants, and fashionable places.', '-87.086603', '20.617637', 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
