(92, 'sold', 'Water Element ', 18, 20, 61, 'AOTULAS.FDS', 1873.00, 174.00, 0.00, 9, 'Avenida Del Parque ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '23', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 0, '', NULL, 'New in Tulum in the Luxury Neighborhood Aldea Zama - 2BR Pet Garden Condo', 'Tulum is a small magical town surrounding by jungle, an amazing destination for those who love to travel, explore and experience a connection with nature. \r\nThe energy of the Mayan ruins, the heat of the sun, and great vibes have made Tulum today, one of the most desirable destinations worldwide. \r\nAldea Zama is a magical residential and eco-touristic zone of the town, which makes it easy to enjoy bike rides toward the hotel zone, amazing beaches, and Mayans Ruins. \r\nThis project is born to honor the most and sacred element: Water. It represents energy, life, flow, and balance. \r\nEach unit (only 9) have their own private pool and private balcony. \r\nWith perfect amenities: Pool, roof-top with bbq area, access to a beach club, and security 24/7. ', '-87.46354879370905', '20.1963347162416', 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
