(94, 'sold', 'Green Areas ', 19, 21, 0, 'AOTULAUM.FDS', 0.00, 0.00, 5382.00, 117, 'Francisco Uh May', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '122', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 0, '', NULL, 'First Plots of Land available in the Coba region ! ', 'Located in the state of Quintana Roo, Tulum was considered one of the important centers of worship for the Mayan culture. It is currently one of the top tourist attractions worldwide.\r\nTheses Lots are situated just 14 miles from the center of Tulum, towards the ruins of CobÃ¡, exists a small town called Francisco Uh May.\r\nIt 20 hectares planned community that will conserve 65% of its Jungle.\r\nIt consists of 117 multi-family and residential lots with over 10 unique amenities: infinity jungle pools, jacuzzi, cold plunge, steams rooms, reading areas, an emblematic bridge with views, organic market, bike paths, pet-friendly areas, fitness center, yoga area, Temazcal. \r\n117 housing lots in 12 blocks with more than 4 land options in different sizes and designs : \r\nLots of 500 m2: between 55,265-66,727 USD \r\nLots of 625 m2: between 70,222-75,856 USD\r\nLots of 798 m2 : betwwen 95,176-116,675 USD\r\nLots of 1000 m2: between 1212,322-146,312 USD ', '-87.5902777', '20.3647222', 0, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
