(139, 'sold', 'New', 18, 20, 64, 'PR-M-V', 3255.00, 302.00, 6073.00, 118, 'RESIDENCIAL OLAS', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '108', 4, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-2rzNFpGSAz_bZqiCBRfQ70yjz0xvAuh/view?usp=sharing', NULL, 'Custom House In Bahia Principe', 'Gorgeous 4-bedroom 4.5-bath house located in Residential Las Olas within the exclusive Bahia Principe Golf & Residence.\r\nIncomparable attention to details to be revealed from the minute you enter this exquisite estate.\r\nShowcasing an open-concept layout with floor to ceiling glass walls that connect the spacious living and dining areas with amazing natural lighting and spacious living areas.\r\nFully equipped chefs kitchen.\r\nBedrooms with en-suite bathrooms. \r\nPrivate, walled exposed aggregate patio, ideal for entertaining, with private swimming pool, sundeck, and direct access to the kitchen.\r\nThe pool area is design this way to take advantage of the perpendicular morning sun and the adjacent afternoon sun.  \r\nPrivate secure parking for 4 cars â€“ (893.40 Sq.Ft.).\r\nNext Level architecture and other key points are giving this Home a big wow factor.\r\nLocated halfway from Playa del Carmen and Tulum, BahÃ­a PrÃ­ncipe offers all the activities and attractions for enjoyment and relaxation. This private residential development has top exclusive services:\r\nâ€¢ 15 restaurants and 7 buffets\r\nâ€¢ 21 bars\r\nâ€¢ 2 golf courses\r\nâ€¢ 4 gym and Spa\r\nâ€¢ 5 pools\r\nâ€¢ Casino\r\nâ€¢ Free transportation to the complex with benefits and discount for all the activities !!\r\n\r\nAmenities inside Residential Los Olas: â€¢ Outdoor gym â€¢ Walking trails â€¢ Cenote â€¢ Yoga â€¢ Zen area â€¢ Pet park â€¢ Cenote â€¢ Sun deck â€¢ Kids area â€¢ Hammocks', '-87.33663943524283', '20.376701520267666', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 564.00, 'bed', '8 month after purchase '),
(140, 'active', 'Great Opportunity ', 18, 3, 54, 'XC-H-V', 7061.00, 656.00, 9687.00, 6, '', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77774', '28', 6, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNM4T3xwfTE', NULL, 'Boutique Hotel ', 'The Xcacel-Xcacelito beach has recently been classified as the best beach in the world, according to the Ibero-American Network for Beach Management and Certification, being classified as \"Class 1\", and this Jungle Boutique Hotel is just 1.5 km from this beautiful paradise.\r\n\r\nThe gorgeous Boutique Hotel with 6 custom-made Suites decorated with local crafts with a Tulum touch. Each suite features an en-suite bathroom, terrace, air conditioning, and incredible pool and jungle views. \r\n4 King Size Suites and 2 Double Suite Matrimonial give a total capacity of 16 guests (in case of adding an extra single or double bed, it has a total capacity to accommodate up to 24 guests).\r\nA great place to carry out events such as weddings, birthdays, anniversary parties, etc.. with a capacity of up to 80 guests.\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢	Restaurant/ Bar / Palapa\r\nâ€¢	Foodservice\r\nâ€¢	Bar\r\nâ€¢	Swimming pool\r\nâ€¢	Rooftop\r\nâ€¢	Lounge area\r\nâ€¢	Spa\r\n\r\nExcellent investment opportunity to buy the property with business already running. Great rating on social network and guaranty ROI.\r\n\r\n5 min. from Xcacel-Xcacelito beach.\r\n10 min. from Xpu-ha y Akumal.\r\n15 min. from Tulum.\r\n45 min. from Cancun International Airport\r\n', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 900.00, 'bed', ''),
(141, 'pending', '', 18, 3, 58, 'TL-SB-V', 0.00, 0.00, 1453128.00, 0, '', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '30', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p7poLpUaeLI', NULL, 'Oceanfront Land In Tulum. 13.5 Hectares.', 'This property has everything from white sandy beaches, panoramic views to freshwater cenotes and private Caleta. The 20-year-old Palm Trees create an unforgettable Caribbean beach ambiance and offer plenty of natural shade to relax with your toes in the sand after your day of swimming, snorkeling, kayaking, kite surfing, shell hunting or just hanging out.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY CHARACTERISTICS:\r\nâ€¢ Total area of 13.5 hectares (32 acres)\r\nâ€¢ Beachfront of 1980 linear meters (6496 feet)\r\nâ€¢ Freshwater cenotes\r\nâ€¢ Private Peninsula with 270-degree ocean views\r\nâ€¢ East access to Federal Highway 307\r\nâ€¢ Private and gated property\r\nâ€¢ There are turtle grass beds near shore in some areas\r\nâ€¢ Coral reef right Infront of the property\r\nâ€¢ Snorkeling and scuba diving locations\r\nâ€¢ Lush mangrove is on the rear\r\n\r\nBesides, this land is one of the only locations in Tulum the falls outside of the protected zone so you can be in Tulum and not be\r\nrestricted on what you can build.\r\n\r\nYour nearest 5-star golf course is just within arm\'s reach. The ruins of Tulum, the turtle sanctuary of Akumal, and even the marina in Puerto Aventuras are just a short drive away.', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 135000.00, 'bed', ''),
(142, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'PL-01-V', 807.00, 75.00, 0.00, 8, '88 St between 10th & 5th Av.', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '127', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2016, 18, '', NULL, '2 Bedroom Condo. Walking Distance To The beach.', 'The location of this complex is one of its greatest attributes - direct access to a spectacular beach. Tranquil bay with ample white sand beaches that hosts one of Playaâ€™s best reefs to scuba or snorkel. \r\nCondo features only the best materials (for floors with oversized light color tiles, chukum walls, SPA inspired marble, and stone designed bathrooms). It comes with modern white kitchens including an electric stove and oven, beautiful Silestone countertops with elegant exhaust hoods. \r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢	Rooftop with incredible ocean view\r\nâ€¢	Rooftop pool\r\nâ€¢	Lounge area\r\nâ€¢	Bar\r\nâ€¢	BBQ area\r\nâ€¢	Covered parking (for cars, bikes and scooters )\r\nThe complex is designed to maximize the benefits of its privileged location.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the architectural layout includes open light cubes which in conjunction with its high ceilings provide incredible luminosity and a sensation of amplitude.\r\nThe newest paved and illuminated extension of the popular La Quinta Ave (5th Ave) with benches and an adequate cycle trail is the first street parallel to the beach.\r\n', '-87.057934', '20.647041', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
