(143, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'PL-02-V', 1055.00, 98.00, 0.00, 11, '54 St. between 10th & 5th Av.', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '17', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, '2 Bedroom Condo In Zazil-Ha. 1 Block To The Beach', 'Playa del Carmen has become the preferred touristic destination in Mexico with a great diversity of attractions: the beautiful beaches, archeological, sites, eco-tourism cultural activities, and all sports.\r\nThis complex is located within one of the prestigious and tranquil areas of Playa del Carmen - Zazil-Ha.\r\nThe project consists of 11 units with modern designs distributed on 5 levels.\r\nEach condo features a spacious terrace, equipped kitchen, open plan living areas, bedrooms with ample closets.\r\nDelivers with high-quality finishes (clear oversized tiles, fresh natural paste in the walls with chukum, marble, stone, and granite SPA inspired bathrooms).\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢	Elevator\r\nâ€¢	Parking (for cars bikes or scooter )\r\nâ€¢	Roof garden overseeing the Caribbean and Cozumel\r\nâ€¢	Infinity rooftop pool\r\nâ€¢	Lounge area\r\nâ€¢	BBQ\r\nâ€¢	Bar\r\n', '-87.063629', '20.639467', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
