(163, 'sold', 'Ocean View', 18, 20, 62, 'BAQ-02-V', 3078.00, 286.60, 0.00, 15, 'Calle Abasolo', '', '1807', '23', '13', '77400', '86', 3, 3, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 19, '', NULL, '3-bedroom Penthouse With Ocean View', 'Great location puts you right at the heart of downtown Isla Mujeres.\r\nExperience with this project a new lifestyle, with all the conveniences and amenities:\r\nâ€¢	Oceanview terraces\r\nâ€¢	Large pool\r\nâ€¢	Golf cart parking lot\r\nâ€¢	Garden\r\nâ€¢	Vacation rental management services\r\n\r\nEasy access to everything: stores, supermarkets, restaurants, cafÃ©s, and bars.\r\nOnly a 10-minute walk away from Playa Norte ranked among the 10 best beaches in the world according to the Tripadvisor Traveler\'s Choice Awards.\r\n', '-86.746235', '21.257981', 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(164, 'sold', 'Ocean Front', 18, 20, 64, 'DHHAPA.FDS', 10355.00, 960.00, 0.00, 0, 'Marina Puerto Aventuras', '', '1810', '23', '26', '77733', '136', 8, 13, 1, 0, 0, 2005, 13, '', NULL, 'Breathtaking Oceanfront Hacienda', 'Gorgeous three-level house with private access to the beach !!! \r\n\r\nLocated in Puerto Aventuras, an exclusive gated marina-golf community with all the amenities: beautiful white sand beaches, two big marinas, a golf course, tennis courts, aquatic activities, cenotes, a variety of restaurants, and hotels, and much more. \r\n\r\nThe first two floors are the kitchen, living room, and bedrooms.  All the bedrooms have a balcony with an ocean view, a full bathroom, and a walk-in closet. \r\nThe third floor is has a sundeck with an umbrella. \r\n\r\nA spectacular newly built Hacienda-style house, facing the Caribbean Sea, fully furnished and equipped !! \r\n\r\nPrivate Amenities:\r\nâ€¢	Private access to the beach\r\nâ€¢	Gym with an ocean view\r\nâ€¢	External parking for 2 cars (guests) \r\nâ€¢	Internal parking for 4 cars ( 2 covered & 2 outdoors)\r\n\r\n\r\n', '-87.230924', '20.497940', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(165, 'active', '', 18, 3, 54, 'SA01SA.FDS', 17760.00, 1650.00, 0.00, 0, 'Calle 6 Norte, Between 15 and 20 Avenue ', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '121', 37, 37, 0, 0, 0, 2017, 2, '', NULL, 'Modern Boutique-Hotel In The Heart Of Playa del Carmen', 'This modern Boutique- Hotel is located in the heart of Playa del Carmen only 3 blocks away from the beach.\r\nHe has 37 rooms with private bathrooms. \r\nRoom Types: Superior room, Double deluxe, and Family room\r\n\r\nPrivate Amenities:\r\n\r\nâ€¢	Rooftop with Pool  Ocean View\r\nâ€¢	Ocean View\r\nâ€¢	Restaurant\r\nâ€¢	Elevator\r\nâ€¢      Storage\r\n', '-87.072715', '20.628108', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(166, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 64, 'ARVB.MS', 21530.00, 2000.00, 0.00, 0, 'Caretera Costera km3', '', '1809', '23', '21', '77760', '84', 10, 12, 2, 0, 0, 2005, 19, '', NULL, 'Beautiful Dream Home in a Island', 'This stunning home located on the island of Cozumel comes with a gorgeous ocean view.\r\nIt has 10 bedrooms, 12 bathrooms, 3 living rooms, 3 dining rooms, and a pantry. \r\nAdditionally, it also contains an anti-nuclear shelter, a private nightclub, an office, a spa, a steam room, and a massage bed with a jungle view. \r\n\r\nThis home is located only a few steps from the ocean, right in front of the Villa Blanca Reef. \r\n\r\nPrivate Amenities: \r\n- Laundry room\r\n- A vegetable garden with several different fruit trees\r\n- A peacock cage\r\n- Two roofed garages\r\n- Emergency power plant for the whole house.', '-86.97619441738212', '20.464706033718493', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(167, 'sold', 'PENDING', 18, 20, 62, 'AR13MS', 5537.00, 515.00, 0.00, 0, 'Puesta del Sol II', '', '1809', '23', '21', '77760', '84', 4, 3, 2, 0, 0, 1991, 19, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zb7wquTSLVU&t=48s', NULL, 'Stunning Penthouse In Cozumel Island', 'This stunning Penthouse is located on the island of Cozumel, just a few steps from the ocean. \r\n\r\nIt is a three-story penthouse with each room containing a full view of the Caribbean sea. \r\n\r\nIt has 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and 2 half bathrooms,  and 2 large living areas along with three terraces.\r\n\r\nThe high ceilings and large windows offer ample light. \r\n\r\nPrivate Amenities:\r\n-  24/7 security  \r\n- Private Pool \r\n- Private access to the beach \r\n- An elevator that leads you to the front door of the penthouse. ', '-86.93246407079464', '20.54189517250781', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
