(174, 'sold', 'Sold', 18, 20, 64, 'SAPAXH.FDS', 3500.00, 325.00, 1550.00, 0, 'Caleta Xel Ha', '', '2455', '23', '105', '77733', '190', 5, 5, 0, 0, 0, 2005, 13, '', NULL, 'Spacious Home With Ocean View in Gated Community With A Marina', 'This beautiful house is located in Puerto Aventuras, a beautiful Marina and Gated Community, an idyllic place in the heart of the Riviera Maya with fine white sand and turquoise waters.\r\nIn this area, the economy and property values are growing very rapidly, making it the ideal place to invest! \r\n\r\nThis home is spacious with a good luminosity and an amazing ocean view. \r\n\r\nAmenities: A private pool and a double garage. ', '-87.07926950000001', '20.6149064', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 144.00, 'bed', ''),
(398, 'sold', 'Great Opportunity', 18, 20, 61, 'DH-SIL2-V', 527.00, 49.00, 0.00, 54, 'Avenida Kukulkan', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 18, '', NULL, 'Good Opportunity To Invest ! 1BR Condo In Increasing Area ', 'Tulum is known for its well-preserved ruins of an ancient port city, located on a white sand beach that gives the sea an exceptional color of turquoise blue. The famous city is also known for its gastronomy, its spirit of freedom, and yogi. \r\n\r\n\r\nThis building is located on the new road that goes all the way to the sea, offering faster and more exclusive access to the beautiful beaches of Tulum.\r\n\r\nThe perfect fusion between modern design and the exuberant nature that surrounds the building, makes a difference in a unique way, making it one of the few 5-star Residences in Tulum with a unique and unrepeatable style.\r\n\r\nWith great amenities:\r\n- Lobby with concierge\r\n- Restaurant, 24/7 Security\r\n- 24/7 Security\r\n- Free Wifi\r\n- Gym\r\n- Spa\r\n\r\nDon\'t miss this opportunity! ', '-87.46866055332954', '20.20080135384493', 0, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
