(184, 'active', 'Great Investment Opportunity', 18, 3, 60, 'LT-HM-V', 829.00, 77.00, 0.00, 68, 'Av. Chemuyil ', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '139', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 2, '', NULL, 'New Business Concept. Offices For Sale.', 'Golden opportunity to invest in a unique business concept, conveniently located in a booming zone of Playa del Carmen. \r\nThe new urban center of the city â€“ the area that is becoming an economic center point of Playa del Carmen. Across the street from the Plaza Las Americas. \r\nThis is the first of its kind platform in Playa del Carmen - corporate office building, designed to promote a healthy work and business environment. \r\nThe project is distributed over 8 levels where 2 levels are allocated for commercial spaces (with a total of 1000 sq.m.) and 6 levels are provided for corporate and business offices (with a total of 4,300 sq.m.).\r\nThe developer created workspaces that can be easily adapted to the needs of any company and offers amenities and services that will make the work environment more satisfying and effective:\r\nâ€¢	Lobby\r\nâ€¢	Cafeteria and dining area\r\nâ€¢	3 Meeting Rooms\r\nâ€¢	Terrace\r\nâ€¢	Lounge Areas\r\nâ€¢	Commercial Area\r\nâ€¢	2 Elevators\r\nâ€¢	Restrooms on each level\r\nâ€¢	Controlled access \r\nâ€¢	Security \r\n\r\nThis project offers offices for companies of all sizes according to their needs. Find the perfect space for you:\r\nâ€¢	Office of 40sq.m. is 1,750,000 MXN ($87,800 USD)\r\nâ€¢	Offices of 50sq.m. is 2,100,000 MXN ($105,350 USD)\r\nâ€¢	Offices of 77sq.m. is 2,560,000 MXN ($128,450 USD)\r\nâ€¢	Offices of 90sq.m. is 3,160,900 MXN ($157,855 USD)\r\nâ€¢	Offices of 360sq.m. is 13,000,000 MXN ($652,150 USD)\r\n', '-87.08137900498609', '20.645969083993744', 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
