(200, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 62, 'FGHOLYUM2.FDS', 160.00, 1722.00, 0.00, 16, 'Calle Mantarra', '', '2444', '23', '0', '', '0', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 19, '', NULL, 'Good Opportunity To Invest ! 2BR Penthouse With Ocean View In Holbox', 'Holbox is located in the Yucatan Peninsula in the state of Quintana Roo; to get there, a 2-hour car/bus ride from Cancun plus a 20-minute ferry ride through the beautiful Yalahau Lagoon is needed.\r\n\r\nHolbox Island is one of the most beautiful beaches in Mexico, due to the fusion of colors caused by the intersection between the Caribbean Sea and the Gulf of Mexico. \r\nYou can find a warm climate all year round and its sea has a low depth with practically no waves, its sand is soft, the predominant vegetation is the mangrove and some palms. \r\n\r\nWith a population of only 5,000 inhabitants, all use bikes, motorcycles, or golf carts for transportation, it makes it a paradise on earth!\r\n\r\nThis building is located in the area of residential growth Holbox Island, just 30 meters from the beach!\r\n\r\nOnly 16 units, it\'s a private neighborhood. \r\n\r\nAmenities: \r\n-Pool\r\n-Sundeck\r\n-Roff-Top\r\n-Yoga Area\r\n-Green Areas', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
