(203, 'sold', 'Soon Delivery', 18, 20, 61, 'DHTMT1.AM', 1033.00, 96.00, 0.00, 69, 'Av. Coba & Carr. Tulum ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77780', '23', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 18, '', NULL, 'Soon Delivery. Contemporary Designed 2BR Condo. ', 'A contemporary designed 2 bedrooms condo, 5 minutes from the beach combines both luxury and comfort while preserving the nature surrounding it. \r\n\r\nEach condo has its own private terraces, is fully furnished, equipped, and decorated.\r\n\r\n Its amenities include :\r\n- A bar\r\n-A boutique cafe\r\n-A spa\r\n-A yoga center\r\n-A gym\r\n-A rooftop with a pool\r\n-A parking\r\n-A laundry area\r\n-A concierge\r\n-24/7 Security\r\n-A vacation rental program\r\n-A condo-hotel service, catering, and room service. \r\n\r\nThere are 2 units available for the pre-sale of this gorgeous development. \r\nDon\'t miss this opportunity !! ', '-87.451583', '20.203986', 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
