(206, 'active', 'No Fees ', 18, 20, 61, 'FDSPMTF2.FDS', 850.00, 79.00, 0.00, 93, 'Avenida Javier Rojo GÃ³mez Nte ', '', '2440', '23', '93', '77580', '215', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 21, '', NULL, 'Ocean-Front Project In Puerto Morelos. Great ROI', 'Located in The Riviera Maya, the enchanting fishing village of Puerto Morelos is located halfway between Cancun and Playa Del Carmen. \r\nOnly 20 min away from Cancun International Airport and 20 min north of Playa del Carmen.\r\n\r\nPuerto Morelos offers the warmth of community and conveniences of home, including a local farmer\'s market, convenience stores, pharmacies, grocery stores, restaurants, and more. It\'s a peaceful destination where your only concern will be to enjoy the sunshine and the turquoise Caribbean sea. \r\n\r\nThis project is a new beachfront concept of full-ownership second home residence. \r\nYou will invest in a condo-hotel, guarantee you a good return of investment, a management program, and all the expenses will be covered by your rentals earnings! (Homeowners insurance, Property tax, Electricity, Water, Maintenance fee, Internet, Cable TV). \r\nPlus specials benefits: High-end furniture and appliances included, Personalized concierge service, Housecleaning included, Membership at The Fives Club. \r\n\r\nAmenities: \r\nâ€¢	2 infinity pools\r\nâ€¢	Private beach club\r\nâ€¢	3 restaurants\r\nâ€¢	A coffee shop\r\nâ€¢	A spa\r\nâ€¢	A fitness center\r\nDon\'t miss this opportunity and contact us! ', '-86.872220', '20.856756', 0, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
