(210, 'active', '', 18, 20, 63, 'AOTULCF.FDS', 2712.00, 252.00, 0.00, 8, 'Calle Nak Be', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77780', '23', 3, 3, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 18, '', NULL, '3-Bedroom Townhouse In Aldea Zama | 2 Private Pools. ', 'Tulum is famous for its white-sand beaches, turquoise sea, and Mayan Ruins. \r\nAldea Zama is the most luxurious residential neighborhood in Tulum and is considered the most conveniently located master development in the entire city: security, privacy, and close to downtown and beautiful beaches. \r\nThis project is a boutique development, with 8 townhouses but only 2 are still available !!\r\nBeautiful resources, and materials such as wood from Tzalam, Maya stone, Chukum walls. \r\nHigh ceilings. \r\nFurniture package available. \r\nAmenities: 2 private pools, private parking, solar panels, bbq area, garden, concierge, and security 24/7. ', '-87.462543', '20.202270', 0, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(211, 'sold', 'Soon Delivery', 18, 20, 61, 'DHTATU1.AM', 1194.00, 111.00, 0.00, 120, 'Av. Coba & Carr. Tulum ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77780', '23', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 18, '', NULL, 'It is designed to enjoy all the comfort in the middle of paradise', 'This new development has created a bohemian and tranquil-style condo just a short driving distance from Ziggys Beach Club. \r\n\r\nThese 2 Bedroom 2 bathroom condos come fully furnished, fully equipped, decorated, and with a private terrace.\r\n\r\nAlong with this, it has:\r\n-  A laundry area\r\n-A private parking\r\n- A restaurant and bar\r\n- A pool\r\n- A yoga room,\r\n- A spa\r\n- A gym\r\n- A paddle-court\r\n- A concierge\r\n-  24/7 security\r\n- Condo-hotel service,\r\n- Free transport to Ziggys Beach Club\r\n- A vacation rental program', '-87.450435', '20.204107', 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
