(213, 'active', 'Condo Hotel', 18, 20, 61, 'GPPMMK1.FDS', 527.00, 49.80, 0.00, 300, 'Carr. CancÃºn - Tulum, Puerto Morelos, Q.R., Mexico', '', '2440', '23', '93', '77580', '143', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2023, 15, '', NULL, 'Amazing Project in Puerto Morelos. 8-minute Drive From The Beach.', 'MayaKaan residence, a project in Puerto Morelos: in this authentic paradise we find the 2nd largest coral reef in the world, a Natural Park, and standing out as a precious place for diving, snorkeling, and various water activities. \r\n\r\nThis real estate development is truly unique as it is supported by Wyndham Hotels and Resorts. The largest hotel company in the world, with more than nine thousand hotels. Through its globally recognized hotel brand, it offers the commercial guarantee that Mayakaan Residences will have high hotel occupancy and attractive rates to guarantee profitability.\r\n\r\nTwo buildings will be built for 2022 and 4 more for 2025, in an environment surrounded by the fantastic landscapes of the jungle and the mangrove swamp. Where modernity meets nature.\r\n\r\nAlso, they are pioneers in the implementation of green technologies, such as Solar Panels for the production of electricity and hot water, electric chargers for Tesla vehicles, low-power LED lighting, wastewater treatment, reuse of treated water for the cooling of the air conditioning, and for the irrigation of gardens, urban waste management, implementation of flora rescue program and 2 trees will be built for each apartment built.\r\n\r\nWith the most exclusive amenities: \r\nâ€¢	Lobby\r\nâ€¢	Sky Pool (5000 square meters)\r\nâ€¢	Cenote and Lagoon\r\nâ€¢	Water Park\r\nâ€¢	Gardens\r\nâ€¢	Waterfall Bar\r\nâ€¢	Beach Club\r\nâ€¢	Wellness Center\r\nâ€¢	Spa\r\nâ€¢	Fitness Center\r\nâ€¢	Medical Clinic\r\nâ€¢	5 restaurants\r\nâ€¢	Amphitheater\r\nâ€¢	Open Cinema \r\nâ€¢	24/7 Security\r\nâ€¢	And much more will be built for 2025:\r\n  Zip-Line, Climbing area, Yoga area, Tennis Area, Kayaking, Paddle area, Archery, Elevated Bridges, Pet-Zone, Parking, Bike Station. \r\n\r\nOnly 15 minutes from the International Airport Cancun and 20 minutes from Playa Del Carmen.  ', '-86.875224', '20.913373', 0, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
