(223, 'active', '', 18, 20, 64, 'ARFG.MS', 1938.00, 180.00, 0.00, 0, 'Colonia Feliz', '', '1809', '23', '21', '77600', '84', 3, 2, 2, 0, 0, 2020, 19, '', NULL, 'Newly Built 3 Bedroom House With Private Pool', 'This 3-Bedroom house with a pool offers privacy giving you the feeling of tranquility and peace. \r\n\r\nLocated in an area surrounded by jungle, a new shopping center with a movie theater, and a 10-minute drive on the Boulevard Airport Road to the Beach.', '-86.92443632069163', '20.503458628114785', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(224, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'GPTAOTUL.FDS', 1787.00, 166.00, 0.00, 90, 'Avenida Central', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '23', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 18, '', NULL, 'Modern 2BR Condo in the Luxury Aldea Zama ', 'Tulum is one of the most visited sunny destinations in the world. From the beautiful Caribean Sea, Cenotes, Shopping, Gastronomy, Incredible wildlife, and Nice weather. \r\n\r\nLocated in the famous and luxury neighborhood: Aldea Zama, where you can enjoy a boho beach club, a range of boutique and relaxed coffee. \r\n\r\nThis project is a generously spaced community where nature has plenty of space, the perfect place to breathe. \r\n\r\nThis penthouse is modern and has its private roof-top with jacuzzi, this large living area captures the impressive panorama, and it\'s ideal for dining or lounging. \r\n\r\nBeautiful amenities: \r\n- 2 pools\r\n- A fitness center\r\n- A yoga deck\r\n- A restaurant & bar\r\n- Botanical gardens\r\n- Access to a beach club in Akumal', '-87.460443', '20.195577', 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(225, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'GPTAOAKS1.FDS', 979.00, 91.00, 0.00, 108, 'Carr Tulum - Cancun , Km 307', '', '2444', '23', '85', '77737', '130', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 21, '', NULL, 'Modern 1BR Condo with Garden ', 'This project is situated in Akumal, a little village near the beautiful Caribbean white-sand beaches. \r\n\r\nLocated inside a resort: the Bahia Principe Hotel, the owners of these condos will enjoy all the amenities from the hotel more benefits, and discounts on food and beverages. \r\n\r\nThis penthouse is an absolute dream home to delight in the beautiful sunset over the crystal clear water of the Mexican Caribbean, and he has his own stunning rooftop with a jacuzzi! \r\n\r\nIn addition to the amenities provides by Bahia Principe Deluxe Resort, this project has:\r\n- 2 privates pools\r\n- A bbq area\r\n- A beach club\r\n- A restaurant & bar\r\n- A fitness center\r\n- A yoga area\r\n- A spa\r\n\r\nAlso Available 2BR Condo With Garden 1,227 sq-feet. \r\nPrice: 249,000 USD', '-87.322962', '20.377291', 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(226, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 62, 'GPTAOAKS2.FDS', 743.00, 69.00, 0.00, 108, 'Carr Tulum - Cancun , Km 307', '', '2444', '23', '85', '77737', '130', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 21, '', NULL, 'Modern 1BR Penthouse With Ocean View', 'This project is situated in Akumal, a little village near the beautiful Caribbean white-sand beaches. \r\n\r\nLocated inside a resort: the Bahia Principe Hotel, the owners of these condos will enjoy all the amenities from the hotel more benefits, and discounts on food and beverages. \r\n\r\nThis penthouse is an absolute dream home to delight in the beautiful sunset over the crystal clear water of the Mexican Caribbean, and he has his own stunning rooftop with a jacuzzi! \r\n\r\nIn addition to the amenities provides by Bahia Principe Deluxe Resort, this project has:\r\n- 2 privates pools\r\n- A bbq area\r\n- A beach club\r\n- A restaurant & bar\r\n- A fitness center\r\n- A yoga area\r\n- A spa\r\n\r\nAlso Available 2BR Penthouse 1,420 sq-feet. \r\nPrices between 331,000 and 374,000 USD. ', '-87.322962', '20.377291', 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(227, 'sold', 'Water View', 18, 20, 61, 'SAPAALL.FDS', 2615.00, 243.00, 0.00, 4, 'Bahia Kantenah', '', '2455', '23', '105', '77733', '191', 3, 3, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 13, '', NULL, 'Stunning  Penthouse On The Lagoon. Walking Distance To The Beach !!', 'Just 15 minutes from Playa del Carmen is Puerto Aventuras, the only tourist and residential community in the Riviera Maya with a marina.\r\nThis gated community features restaurants, bars, a bilingual school, a golf course, direct access to the beach, and the possibility of having your own house or condo with easy access to the sea! \r\n\r\nThis project has an unbeatable location, overlooking the lagoon of Puerto Aventuras, and only 30 meters from the beach.\r\n\r\nThe pleasure of living quietly, in harmony, in an exclusive project with only 4 units, each apartment has 3 bedrooms, with ample spaces and first-class finishes! \r\n\r\nAmenities: \r\n- Private pool \r\n- Parking (10,000 USD extra value)', '-87.21846165992187', '20.504016191350413', 0, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(228, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'GPPDCAQ.FDS', 1120.00, 104.00, 0.00, 27, 'Calle 42 Nte, 5th Avenue', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '5', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 18, '', NULL, '5th Av & 42 St |  2-Bedroom Condo Turnkey ', 'This project is an exclusive boutique concept with a superb architectural design, which makes the project an icon. \r\n\r\nNear 5th Avenue and from Coco Beach !! \r\n\r\nA lot of amenities: \r\n- Lobby with concierge\r\n- Infinity pool\r\n- Gym\r\n- Spa\r\n-Roof-top/bar\r\n-Laundry room\r\n- Elevator\r\n- 24/7 security \r\n\r\nAll furnished, equipped and decorated with beautiful marble floors. ', '-87.06409045224518', '20.63610626990912', 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
