(232, 'sold', 'Sustainable', 18, 20, 61, 'GPTULCPR1.FDS', 463.00, 43.00, 0.00, 38, 'Calle 18 Sur, La Veleta ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 18, '', NULL, 'New Opportunity to Invest in Tulum - Sustainable Studios ', 'A small Caribbean town known as a quiet, exotic, cosmopolitan, sustainable city, inhabited by a great international community, amazing weather, and wonderful beaches.\r\nTulum is the number one luxury destination (Wellness/relaxation/eco-conscious-lifestyle) in Mexico and in many Latin-American countries.                                                                                                                                                \r\n2 hours from the International Airport of Cancun, and 1 hour from the well-known Playa del Carmen.     \r\n                                                                                                                                         \r\nThis condo is an innovative sustainable real estate, make a positive impact in the world by choosing a property that exemplifies sustainability: artificial rivers interconnecting throughout the property, nestled in the jungle, up to 60% of the vegetation will be conserved and used as part of the property footprint, wastewater treatment systems, site, and material selection, daylighting, waste reduction and zero-emission mobility, electric vehicle charging stations, intricate solar panels, and intelligent wind turbines.   \r\n\r\nAll the amenities you need:\r\n- Fitness Center\r\n- Spa\r\n- Beach Club\r\n-  Lounge\r\n- Restaurant\r\n- Concierge', '-87.467780', '20.198670', 0, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
