(235, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'AOTULHABA1.FDS', 377.00, 35.00, 0.00, 16, 'Avenida Del Parque ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '23', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 18, '', NULL, 'Pure And Modern Studios in Aldea Zama', 'Tulum is one of the most emblematic touristic areas in Mexico since it offers a unique experience through the connection with nature. \r\nThe beautiful Maya Ruins, the white sand beaches, and the Turquoise Sea making it one of the most important destinations for Mexicans and foreigners. \r\n\r\nThis project is 16 exclusive apartments in the heart of the city, with a privileged location within Aldea Zama. \r\n\r\nThese beautiful condos have natural light and ventilation, neutral tones and textures, creating a peaceful atmosphere where the wood provides warmth, regional materials such as polished cement, stone and chukum walls, lattices of tzalam wood with a lot of natural vegetation.\r\n\r\nTop Amenities:\r\n-  Infinity pool\r\n- Roof-top\r\n- Jacuzzi\r\n- BBQ Area\r\n- Fitness Center\r\n- Yoga Area\r\n- Lobby with Concierge\r\n- 24/7 Security\r\n- Elevator', '-87.46160640948054', '20.196945856303216', 0, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
