(237, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'SATULKUK1.FDS', 1152.00, 107.00, 0.00, 19, 'Btw Avenida Kukulcan and Avenida Del Parque', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '23', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 18, '', NULL, 'Beautiful Condo Hotel in Aldea Zama Premium ! 2BR Pet Garden', 'Tulum, its white-sand beaches and turquoise sea. Its tranquil lifestyle where you can enjoy life in the Caribbean. \r\n\r\nThis project is a complex of 19 apartments immersed in the jungle with a natural concept that prioritizes contact with nature and the use of local materials.\r\n\r\nYou have a return on investment of up to 12%. Because you not only become the owner of an apartment but also of a luxury hotel. You have the possibility to put your apartment in a vacation rental or hotel pool. \r\n\r\nAmenities: \r\n- Pool\r\n- Hammac\r\n- Parking\r\n- Yoga Area\r\n- Gardens\r\n-  24/7 Security\r\n- Bike Parking', '-87.467519', '20.203064', 0, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
