(239, 'sold', 'Prime Location', 18, 20, 61, 'FGHOLCHER.FDS', 1044.00, 97.00, 0.00, 7, 'Calle Zargo', '', '2446', '23', '92', '77310', '140', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 19, '', NULL, 'Good Opportunity To Invest ! 2BR Condo On The Beach in The Paradise Island Of Holbox', 'Holbox is located in the Yucatan Peninsula in the state of Quintana Roo; to get there, a 2-hour car/bus ride from Cancun plus a 20-minute ferry ride through the beautiful Yalahau Lagoon is needed.\r\n\r\nHolbox Island is one of the most beautiful beaches in Mexico, due to the fusion of colors caused by the intersection between the Caribbean Sea and the Gulf of Mexico. You can find a warm climate all year round and its sea has a low depth with practically no waves, its sand is soft, the predominant vegetation is the mangrove and some palms. \r\n\r\nWith a population of only 5,000 inhabitants, all use bikes, motorcycles, or golf carts for transportation, it makes it a paradise on earth!\r\n\r\nThis building is located in the area of residential growth Holbox Island, just 100 meters from the beach!\r\nOnly 7 units, it\'s a private neighborhood. \r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\n-  Pool\r\n- Fitness Center\r\n- Laundry\r\n- Green Areas', '-87.3884215333424', '21.516060742106564', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(240, 'active', 'Prime Location', 18, 20, 61, 'AOTULAS.FDS', 1873.00, 174.00, 0.00, 9, 'Avenida Del Parque ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '23', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 18, '', NULL, 'New in Tulum in the Luxury Neighborhood Aldea Zama - 2BR Pet Garden Condo', 'Tulum is a small magical town surrounding by jungle, an amazing destination for those who love to travel, explore and experience a connection with nature. \r\n\r\nThe energy of the Mayan ruins, the heat of the sun, and great vibes have made Tulum today, one of the most desirable destinations worldwide. \r\n\r\nAldea Zama is a magical residential and eco-touristic zone of the town, which makes it easy to enjoy bike rides toward the hotel zone, amazing beaches, and Mayans Ruins. \r\n\r\nThis project is a lifestyle! Inspired by the magic possibilities, mystic, and natural wonders of Tulum.  \r\n\r\nWith perfect amenities: \r\n- Pool\r\n- Roof-top with bbq area\r\n- Access to a beach club\r\n- Security 24/7', '-87.463502', '20.196203', 0, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(241, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'AOTULASV.FDS', 1959.00, 182.00, 0.00, 6, 'Avenida Del Parque ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '23', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 18, '', NULL, 'New in Tulum in the Luxury Neighborhood Aldea Zama - 2BR Pet Garden Condo', 'Tulum is a small magical town surrounding by jungle, an amazing destination for those who love to travel, explore and experience a connection with nature. \r\n\r\nThe energy of the Mayan ruins, the heat of the sun, and great vibes have made Tulum today, one of the most desirable destinations worldwide. \r\n\r\nAldea Zama is a magical residential and eco-touristic zone of the town, which makes it easy to enjoy bike rides toward the hotel zone, amazing beaches, and Mayans Ruins. \r\n\r\nThis project is a lifestyle! Inspired by the magic possibilities, mystic, and natural wonders of Tulum.  \r\n\r\nWith perfect amenities: \r\n- Pool\r\n- Roof-top with bbq area\r\n- Access to a beach club\r\n- Security 24/7', '-87.463502', '20.196203', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(242, 'sold', 'Amazing Deal ', 18, 20, 61, 'FDTF.FDS', 522.00, 48.00, 0.00, 0, 'Avenida 10 con Calle 2 ', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '5', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2009, 18, '', NULL, 'Ocean View One Bedroom  - The Fives Downtown Hotel ', 'A new concept of full-ownership second home residences allowed the owner to stay in the condo 56 days per year and assures in return on investment, a carefree maintenance and management program. \r\n\r\nNo Tax and No HOA\r\n\r\nOwnerâ€™s club benefits include:\r\n-  Airport Transportation\r\n- Daily house cleaning\r\n- 24-hour Room Service\r\n- Rooftop infinity pool\r\n- Fitness center\r\n- Spa\r\n- Private Beach Club\r\n- 15% fixed discount throughout the year in the developmentâ€™s Restaurants, Bars & Spa\r\n- Membership at The Fives Club\r\n', '-87.075260', '20.624011', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(243, 'active', '', 18, 20, 64, 'SA07CU.FDS', 2152.00, 200.00, 0.00, 0, 'La Veleta ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 4, 4, 0, 0, 0, 2018, 18, '', NULL, 'Amazing Villa 4BR with a Pool - Good Opportunity in Tulum ! ', 'Brand new villa with a modern design only a 10-minute drive from downtown and the incredible beaches of the Caribbean Sea.\r\n\r\nLet yourself be seduced by the nature of Tulum in an environment of luxury and comfort.\r\n\r\nA beautiful villa of 4 bedrooms and 4,5 bathrooms, offers all the comforts to relax in the rooms or in the common areas, indoors as well as outdoors. \r\n\r\nThe chefâ€™s kitchen with ample storage space. \r\nThe living and dining rooms are combined in a large open area very well naturally lightened.\r\n\r\nAll bedrooms feature an en-suite bathroom, spacious closet area, ceiling fan, and powerful air conditioning. \r\n\r\nFully furnished with all convenience: \r\n- Laundry area\r\n- Private pool with lounge area\r\n- Secure parking\r\n\r\nAn ideal place to enjoy measured rhythm away from the noise of the city.', '-87.47302909165049', '20.201566475449642', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(244, 'active', 'LAST UNIT', 18, 20, 61, 'FDSBACAM1.FDS', 1033.00, 96.00, 0.00, 144, 'Autopista Chetumal-Cancun, Km 307', '', '2449', '23', '95', '77930', '147', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 20, '', NULL, 'Beautiful Layout! 1 Bedroom Condo In Bacalar', 'Bacalar, the \"magic village\" with thick vegetation crowned by an imposing accumulation of turquoise water called: \"The Seven Colors Lagoon\" a jewel that stretches over 42km. \r\n\r\nThis lagoon has shallow water and soft white sand. An Ideal place to inhabit and connect with nature in an atmosphere of tranquility.\r\n An amazing environment to practice watersports such as kayak, paddle, and catamaran. \r\n\r\nBacalar is located between two important cities, near Chetumal airport (30km) and 2 hours from the city of Tulum.\r\n\r\nThis complex is the first project in the area, it offers a unique, luxurious, and sustainable (water treatment) lifestyle to its residents. \r\nThis development includes 8 hectares of a jungle of which 70% will be conserved, it will count 8 exclusive towers of 3 floors and 18 apartments each, separated by 20 meters of the endemic jungle. \r\n\r\n5-minutes ride to the village. \r\n\r\nBeautiful amenities: \r\n- Jogging track\r\n- Paddle \r\n- Tennis Court\r\n- Indoor gym\r\n- Open jungle gym\r\n- Spa\r\n- Yoga area\r\n- Pool with view on the lagoon\r\n- A sundeck to the lagoon\r\n- Bbq area\r\n- Restaurant\r\n- Kids club\r\n- Parking for each tower\r\n- Security 24/7\r\n', '-88.420859', '18.619505', 1, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
