(247, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'BACAM1.V', 1033.00, 96.00, 0.00, 144, 'Autopista Chetumal-Cancun, Km 307', '', '2449', '23', '95', '77930', '147', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 20, '', NULL, 'Exclusive Residential Complex On The Shore Of The Seven Colors Lagoon Of Bacalar', 'An exclusive residential complex on the shore of the seven colors lagoon of Bacalar. The only residential project on the lagoon that has a private access to the lagoon (exclusive for its residents), lounge area on the water and private dock, among other amenities.\r\n\r\nThis development includes 8 hectares of a jungle of which 70% will be conserved, it will count 8 exclusive towers of 3 floors and 18 apartments each, separated by 20 meters of the endemic jungle. \r\n\r\nThe last 2 towers are open for sale - last condos are available within the project.\r\nAmenities: \r\nâ€¢ Jogging track\r\nâ€¢ Paddle tennis\r\nâ€¢ Indoor gym\r\nâ€¢ Open jungle gym\r\nâ€¢ Spa\r\nâ€¢ Yoga area\r\nâ€¢ Pool with view on the lagoon\r\nâ€¢ Sundeck to the lagoon\r\nâ€¢ BBQ area\r\nâ€¢ Restaurant\r\nâ€¢ Kids club\r\nâ€¢ Parking for each tower\r\nâ€¢ Security 24/7. \r\n\r\n5-minutes ride from the center of Bacalar and soon in the passage of the Mayan Train. ', '-88.420859', '18.619505', 1, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
