(250, 'sold', 'Sold', 18, 20, 64, 'SAPDCBAM.FDS', 3950.00, 367.00, 5834.00, 0, 'Bambu Residencial', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '139', 4, 4, 1, 0, 0, 2016, 18, '', NULL, 'Beautiful Villa In Increasing Area !! Really Good Opportunity To Invest !!', 'Beautiful House in an increasing area in Playa Del Carmen. \r\n\r\n3 Bedrooms: 1 master room, 2 other bedrooms, and one maid\'s room, 4 bathrooms. \r\n\r\nLarges spaces, good luminosity, amazing patio to enjoy outdoor activities, a jacuzzi, and a pool in common. \r\n\r\nSustainable equipped with solars panels. \r\n\r\nGarage for 2 cars. \r\n\r\nContact us for more information! \r\n', '-87.079730', '20.638547', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(251, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 64, 'BGVPPDC.AM', 2000.00, 186.00, 0.00, 0, 'Retorno. Sayil 24, Playacar.', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77717', '1', 5, 5, 1, 0, 0, 2005, 13, '', NULL, 'Gorgeous 5 BR Turnkey Villa in Playacar', 'This beautiful 5 bedrooms 5 bathroom turnkey villa is located in a gated community within Playacar. The amenities include:\r\n\r\n-Wrap around pool\r\n-Tennis Court\r\n-Rooftop with jacuzzi\r\n-Access to the Reef Hotel\r\n-Spa and steam room\r\n-Private Cenote\r\n-Many Terraces\r\n-Cul-de-sac\r\n-Gated Community\r\n\r\n', '-87.089894', '20.613375', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(252, 'sold', 'Condo Hotel', 18, 20, 61, 'AOTULAMA1.FDS', 581.00, 54.00, 0.00, 245, 'Avenida Coba', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '23', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 18, '', NULL, 'Amazing Project With Lush Vegetation ! Studio With Garden', 'Tulum is one of the most emblematic touristic areas in Mexico since it offers a unique experience through the connection with nature. \r\n\r\nThe beautiful Maya Ruins, the white sand beaches, and the Turquoise Sea making it one of the most important destinations for Mexicans and foreigners. \r\n\r\nThis project is located just minutes away from the beach, also a short bike ride away from downtown Tulum and tourist attractions.\r\n\r\nA residential resort that tastefully blends luxury condominiums with a retail area that offers residents, guests, and visitors a choice array of services and amenities: \r\n- Large Commun Pool\r\n- Fitness Center\r\n- Yoga Area\r\n- Tennis Court\r\n- Mini-Golf\r\n- Restaurant\r\n- Cafe\r\n- Boutiques\r\n- Lounge\r\n- Market\r\n- Ice-Cream Shop\r\n- Pet Park\r\n- Kids Club\r\n- Co-working Space\r\n- 24/7 Security\r\n\r\nHowever, this project offers a full hotel service: room cleaning services, room service, and concierge. \r\n\r\nAnd of course, it is an eco-friendly development, designed to be as self-sufficient as possible and to value the local environment: solar panels, a water treatment plant, organic waste disposal, rainwater collector, and local materials. ', '-87.447323', '20.206570', 0, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
