(273, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'AOTULSAA1.FDS', 1614.00, 150.00, 0.00, 19, 'Entre Calle Tzolkin y Calle 8 Sur', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 2, 2, 1, 0, 0, 2020, 18, '', NULL, 'Easy Acces To Everithing. 2BR Condo with Garden in La Veleta.', 'Located in Tulum, La Veleta, this is a peaceful area, near downtown, restaurants, shopping, and beautiful beaches. \r\n\r\nThis residence of only 19 units, will feature comfortable and spacious areas with floor-to-ceiling windows creating splendid interior-exterior living spaces.\r\n\r\nCommon areas include:\r\n- A Pool of 70 sq-feet\r\n- A sundeck\r\n- A parking\r\n- 24/7 security\r\n\r\nOptional: Solar Panel installation.\r\nTurn-key package with furniture, accessories, and decoration is available.\r\n', '-87.47699135751702', '20.20501156219876', 0, 0, 0, 0, 8, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(255, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'SACOZES1.FDS', 1259.00, 117.00, 0.00, 30, 'Carr Costera Sur, Km 6.5', '', '1809', '23', '21', '77600', '84', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 19, '', NULL, 'Amazing Project in Cozumel Surrounded by Nature ! 1BR Condo', 'Just a few kilometers from Playa del Carmen shore, along the famous Mexican Mayan Riviera, Cozumel is a well-established world-class destination. \r\n\r\nThe goal of this project is to reach a state of peace. Between the sounds of birds and jungle landscapes, this environment is peaceful and safe. \r\n\r\nJust 15 minutes ride from downtown, the ferry to Playa Del Carmen and Airport.\r\n \r\nAmenities: \r\n- Pool,\r\n-Jacuzzi\r\n-Roof-top\r\n-Gym indoor and outdoor\r\n-Parking\r\n-Beach Club\r\n-Golf Course', '-86.949287', '20.461577', 0, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
