(283, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'GPTAOAK1.FDS', 775.00, 72.00, 0.00, 390, 'Carr Tulum - Cancun , Km 307', '', '2444', '23', '85', '77737', '152', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2019, 21, '', NULL, 'Beautiful And Modern Loft Inside a Resort ', 'This project is situated in Akumal, a little village near the beautiful Caribbean white-sand beaches. \r\n\r\nLocated inside a resort: the Bahia Principe Hotel, the owners of these condos will enjoy all the amenities from the hotel more benefits, and discounts on food and beverages. \r\n\r\nThis condo features a spacious master suite decorated with impeccable taste, a beautiful bathroom, and a cozy contemporary kitchen. \r\n\r\nIn addition to the amenities provides by Bahia Principe Deluxe Resort, this project has 2 privates pools, a bbq area, a beach club, a restaurant & bar, a fitness center, a yoga area, and a spa. ', '-87.334971', '20.379941', 0, 0, 0, 0, 12, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
(284, 'sold', 'LAST UNIT', 18, 20, 62, 'GPTAOAK2.FDS', 2013.00, 187.00, 0.00, 390, 'Carr Tulum - Cancun , Km 307', '', '2444', '23', '85', '77737', '152', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2019, 21, '', NULL, 'Beautiful And Modern 2BR Penthouse Inside a Resort ', 'This project is situated in Akumal, a little village near the beautiful Caribbean white-sand beaches. \r\n\r\nLocated inside a resort: the Bahia Principe Hotel, the owners of these condos will enjoy all the amenities from the hotel more benefits, and discounts on food and beverages. \r\n\r\nThis penthouse features two elegant bedrooms, a lovely living room, an open bright kitchen, and oversize windows that ensure beautiful views! Not only that! These penthouses have their own stunning rooftop with a jacuzzi! \r\n\r\nIn addition to the amenities provides by Bahia Principe Deluxe Resort, this project has 2 privates pools, a bbq area, a beach club, a restaurant & bar, a fitness center, a yoga area, and a spa. ', '-87.334971', '20.379941', 0, 0, 0, 0, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(285, 'sold', 'Sale Pending', 18, 20, 64, 'SA06SA', 1959.00, 182.00, 0.00, 0, 'Riviera Tulum', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '33', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2015, 18, '', NULL, 'Brand New 2BR Villa in Riviera Tulum ', 'This incredible house is located in the heart of a private and gated community of the â€œRiviera Tulumâ€. \r\n\r\nWith custom finishing and a modern layout, this one has it all.\r\nThis amazing design leaves large open living areas both in and outdoor. \r\nThe well-equipped kitchen is roomy and outfitted for a chef. A lot of cabinet storage areas and a large fridge.\r\nSpacious and comfortable rooms feature en-suite bathrooms, a spacious closet area, a ceiling fan, and powerful air conditioning.\r\n\r\nA must-see! Move-in ready, renting, or both; use it when you wish and rent it easy for the rest of the year.\r\n\r\nAt a short distance from the beautiful beaches of Tulum, with restaurants, bars, luxury hotels, and archaeological ruins that highlight the wonders that this majestic place hides.', '-87.47311599999999', '20.220283', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
