(732, 'active', '', 19, 20, 62, 'PDCAN1P-V', 1162.50, 108.00, 0.00, 0, 'Calle 20 con Av. 100', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '14', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 2025, 18, '', NULL, '2-Level Penthouse in Ejido, Playa del Carmen â€“ MXN 2,850,000', '2-level penthouse for sale in Playa del Carmen, located on 20th Street & 100th Avenue in the Ejido neighborhood.\r\n6 minutes by car to Plaza las AmÃ©ricas (cinema, gym, shops & cafÃ©s) and 10 minutes to Fifth Avenue and the beach.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nâ€¢ 1 bedroom / 1.5 bathrooms\r\nâ€¢ 108 mÂ² of total space on 2 levels\r\nâ€¢ Includes parking space\r\nâ€¢ Building with 8 units (3 floors)\r\nâ€¢ 90% finished â€“ applies for bank financing\r\nâ€¢ Equipped but not furnished (photos are from the showroom)\r\nâ€¢ Ready to add your own style and finishing touches\r\n\r\nNote: The building does not have a pool.\r\nPrice is in Mexican pesos (MXN) â€“ USD price may vary with the exchange rate.', '', '', 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(723, 'pending', '', 18, 20, 62, 'ATP4-V', 3121.50, 290.00, 0.00, 0, 'South 8th Street', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '204', 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'Luxurious 2-bedroom Penthouse in Peaceful Tulum, Right Next to Holistika Wellness Center.', 'Welcome to this luxurious 2-bedroom penthouse, located in a serene and quiet neighborhood of Tulum, right next to Holistika Wellness center. The complex consists of only 24 condos, ensuring utmost privacy and exclusivity.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the penthouse, you\'ll immediately notice the elegant and sophisticated design, with high-quality finishes and tasteful dÃ©cor, as well as a private jacuzzi, located in the living area.\r\nThe lock-off system in one of the bedrooms allows for flexibility in usage and the possibility to sublet the property.\r\n\r\nThe private rooftop terrace is truly a highlight of this penthouse, spanning over 145m2 and featuring a stunning 4-meter pool, a BBQ area, and a half bathroom for added convenience.\r\nThe penthouse also comes with a laundry room / stockroom.\r\n\r\nAmenities within the complex:\r\nâ€¢ Swimming pool\r\nâ€¢ Palapa\r\nâ€¢ Gym\r\nâ€¢ Workspace with air conditioning and fast internet (starlink), perfect for remote work or studying.\r\nâ€¢ Green areas\r\nâ€¢ Parking\r\n\r\nAn easy access to the Holistika community wellness center, which offers a range of health and wellness services.', '-87.48391521877929', '20.199178007925774', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(673, 'active', '', 0, 3, 54, 'DHHRT-V', 11550.00, 1073.00, 2152.00, 0, '', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '121', 16, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'NEW | 4-Star Boutique Hotel | Central Location - 10th Av.', 'One of the best locations in Playa del Carmen. This 4-star boutique hotel sits right on 10 Av. in the heart of the city. The views are quite unique as you can see the length of 10th Av. up and down including the ocean from the south. .\r\n16 suites total distributed over 5 levels plus a rooftop with partial ocean view.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\nâ€¢ 16 Keys (4 unit types)\r\nâ€¢ 3 commercial spaces on the ground floor that are currently rented (including a restaurant)\r\nâ€¢ Swimming pool & lounge area\r\nâ€¢ Bar / breakfast area\r\nâ€¢ Elevator\r\nâ€¢ Reception \r\nâ€¢ Public parking nearby', '-87.069160', '20.633065', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 200.00, 'bed', ''),
(297, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'DHPATN.AM', 355.00, 33.00, 0.00, 9, 'Bahia de Yanten', '', '2455', '23', '105', '77733', '192', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 13, '', NULL, 'Lovely Studio With Marina Views', 'Beautiful Studio located in Puerto Aventuras.\r\n\r\nFilled with high-quality architecture in a modern and nautic style.\r\n\r\nAmenities include a :\r\n- Swimming pool\r\n- A boat dock\r\n- A common rooftop with 2 jacuzzis\r\n- A common laundry\r\n- A lobby\r\n\r\nAlong with these amenities, the location of this studio offers even more benefits. \r\nPuerto Aventuras is packed with fun activities such as sailing, a golf course, many restaurants and bars, and an open-air theater. ', '-87.231242', '20.500044', 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
