(315, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'GPPDCLC1.FDS', 592.00, 55.00, 0.00, 28, 'Calle 34 between 10 & 20 Av', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '5', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 18, '', NULL, '1BR Condo with a Great Location, Walking Distance to the Beach', 'L Condos is located in the heart of Playa del Carmen, where the magic happens. \r\n\r\nThis development is only a few steps from the renowned 5th Avenue, the beach, and shopping centers. \r\n\r\nAlso, the easy access to the highway and to the most important spots of the city, make L Condos a smart investment. \r\n\r\nGood amenities: \r\n- Lobby/ Concierge\r\n- Fitness Center\r\n- Pool/Sky Bar/Solarium\r\n- Elevator\r\n- Covered Parking\r\n- Security 24/7', '-87.065592', '20.635470', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(316, 'sold', 'Great Opportunity', 18, 20, 61, 'GPPDCCT1.FDS', 495.00, 46.00, 0.00, 30, 'Calle 25 Sur & Calle Diagonal 85 Sur', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '14', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 18, '', NULL, 'Good Opportunity To Invest In Playa Del Carmen for this 1 BR Condo', 'Playa Del Carmen is in a strategic position to take full advantage of the fascinating Riviera Maya: wonderful white beaches and turquoise sea, cenotes, UNESCO world with amazing archaeological areas, natural parks, and the second most extensive coral reef in the world. \r\n\r\nThis Residence is placed in the south of the city, near the shopping center \"Centro Maya\", and just a few minute\'s drive from the beach and downtown. \r\n\r\nGood amenities: \r\n- Pool\r\n- Sundeck\r\n- Jacuzzi\r\n- Area bbq\r\n- Fitness Center\r\n- Meditation Area\r\n- Parking (extra cost) \r\n- Lobby ', '-87.09450026080519', '20.626555694022432', 0, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
