(338, 'sold', 'Prime Location', 18, 20, 61, 'GPPDCIMME.FDS', 417.80, 38.82, 0.00, 50, 'Calle 10 Entre Avenida 20 y 25 ', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '16', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 18, '', NULL, 'Turnkey Studio In The Center.', 'Considered one of the most attractive tourist destinations in the world, Playa del Carmen is a piece of paradise located in the heart of the unique Mayan Riviera.\r\n\r\nThis project has 50 apartments and studios with modern designs throughout our facilities.\r\n\r\nThe apartments include unique luxury amenities, ensuring a reliable investment and high profitability: \r\n- Controlled and personalized access\r\nto the Lobby\r\n- 24-hour security\r\n- Covered Parking\r\n- Elevators\r\n- Green areas\r\n- Pool with a wading pool for children\r\n- Sundeck with ocean view\r\n- Gym\r\n- Bar\r\n- Open Jacuzzi\r\n- Terraces and hammocks\r\n- Fire pit', '-87.07550288913122', '20.627337524876754', 0, 0, 0, 0, 12, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
