(360, 'sold', '', 18, 3, 66, 'PCBPPM.AM', 17222.00, 1600.00, 15586.00, 8, '', '', '2440', '23', '93', '77580', '142', 23, 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, 24, '', NULL, 'Seaside building with 6 apartments, a pent-house and a studio.', 'Each apartment has an area of 200m2:  each one, with 3 bedrooms, 3 and 1â„2 bathrooms, with balconies and all with ocean view.\r\n\r\nThe ocean view pent-house has an area of 400 m2 with an entrance hall, living room, dining room, fully equipped kitchen and 4 bedrooms with bathrooms each, a jacuzzi, balconies, four terraces, a pantry and a maid\'s room.\r\n\r\nThe entire building has first class finishes, porcelain tile floors, granite countertops, elevator, oceanfront pool and parking for each apartment.\r\nParking for each of the apartments.\r\n\r\nLand: 1,448 m2\r\nConstruction: 1,600 m2\r\n', '-86.87194738252589', '20.854987402319864', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1448.00, 'bed', ''),
