(397, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 64, 'NKDPDC.AM', 1614.00, 150.00, 0.00, 0, 'Casa 6, Privada Diamante', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77716', '178', 3, 2, 1, 0, 0, 2012, 13, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VLIIGFv7iIY', NULL, '3-Bedroom House In La Joya. Private Gated Community. Great Location.', 'This lovely 3 bedroom home is in a gated community with only 30 homes, making it very private, peaceful, and safe. It is 2 minutes from Centro Maya and 5 minutes from the beach. Its amenities include:\r\n-Garden\r\n-Community Pool\r\n- Patio\r\n-Balcony\r\n-Walk-in Closet\r\n', '-87.1038158411614', '20.620333313160934', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(399, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 62, 'GPTULBL2.FDS', 1937.00, 180.00, 0.00, 54, 'Avenida Kukulkan', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 18, '', NULL, 'Top Floor Unit | 180m2 | Private Pool', 'This building is located on the new road that goes all the way to the sea, offering faster and more exclusive access to the beautiful beaches of Tulum.\r\n\r\nThe perfect fusion between modern design and the exuberant nature that surrounds the building, makes a difference in a unique way, making it one of the few 5-star Residences in Tulum with a unique and unrepeatable style.\r\n\r\nWith great amenities:\r\n- Lobby with concierge\r\n- Restaurant, 24/7 Security\r\n- 24/7 Security\r\n- Free Wifi\r\n- Gym\r\n- Spa\r\n\r\nFurniture package available.\r\nDon\'t miss this opportunity! ', '-87.46866055332954', '20.20080135384493', 0, 0, 0, 0, 11, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(400, 'sold', 'Condo Hotel', 18, 20, 0, 'GPTULCHAAC.FDS', 387.00, 36.00, 0.00, 96, 'Entre Calle 8 Sur y Calle 33 Poniente', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '31', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'Beautiful Studios - Condo Hotel - A Good Opportuniy To Invest ! ', 'Tulum, a region known especially for its history and culture, because in the past it served as one of the main commercial ports in the Mayan civilization. Currently, this ancient city is visited by millions of people from all over the world, who come to discover the mysticism that still surrounds its archeological zone and who seek to reconnect with nature.\r\n\r\nThe contemporary architecture of this project seeks to create open spaces,\r\nintercommunicated with each other through walkers, and use the\r\nmaterials and colors, such as wood and chukum, the characteristic\r\nthe rustic look of Tulum.\r\nAnd, with a panoramic view of the Mayan jungle. \r\n\r\nWith perfect amenities:\r\n- Pool\r\n- Jacuzzi\r\n- Gym\r\n- Yoga Area\r\n- Bar\r\n- Restaurant\r\n- Temazcal\r\n- Commun Laundry Room\r\n- Elevator', '-87.4672776984257', '20.195543474005557', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.00, 'studio', '2 Phases: June 2022 and December 2022'),
(401, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'GPTULRP.FDS', 45.00, 484.00, 0.00, 13, 'Entre Calle 5 y 7 Poniente', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2023, 18, '', NULL, 'Turnkey Studio With Jacuzzi. La Veleta', 'Tulum, a region known especially for its history and culture, because in the past it served as one of the main commercial ports in the Mayan civilization. Currently, this ancient city is visited by millions of people from all over the world, who come to discover the mysticism that still surrounds its archeological zone and who seek to reconnect with nature.\r\n\r\nThis project constitutes the 4th stage of large real estate development. \r\nThe developer paid great attention to the quality of materials and the architecture. \r\n \r\nWith a privileged location in Tulum: Region 15, the greatest capital gain in the city! And good amenities: \r\n- Roof-Top with a Pool\r\n- Gym\r\n-Sundeck\r\n-Kitchen in common\r\n- Parking\r\n- Bicycle Rack', '-87.47078689696274', '20.19882490207468', 0, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
(402, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'GPTULOM1.FDS', 947.00, 88.00, 0.00, 34, 'Avenida Coba', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '23', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 18, '', NULL, 'Stunning Double Studio In The Most Exclusive Area in Tulum', 'It is a wonderful place, ideal for nature lovers, Tulum immerses you in the Mayan culture and beaches, of unique beauty, recognized as the best in Mexico and Central America. Its natural beauty makes it a magical place with a unique experience for the soul and the senses, allowing you to live in a state of awe. \r\n\r\nMore than residential development, this construction is a community formed by 34 apartments, a place that invites rest and tranquility in an atmosphere where you can appreciate the privacy for which it was designed.\r\nThe project was purposely created to have complete harmony with what Tulum\r\nrepresents; nature, quiet, placidity, joy, delight, freedom, and calm. \r\nAn environment that always welcomes and invites you to stay and enjoy living in\r\nparadise from the swing of a hammock. \r\n\r\nAnd in the most prestigious Area in Tulum: Aldea Zama. \r\n\r\nBeautiful amenities: \r\n- Pool\r\n- Hammock area\r\n- Sundeck\r\n- 24/7 Security\r\n- Elevator\r\n- Bicycle Rack', '-87.45081471311617', '20.205311412588372', 0, 0, 0, 0, 10, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
