(558, 'sold', 'New', 18, 20, 64, 'AR-BS-V', 4468.00, 415.00, 10333.00, 0, 'Bahia Soliman', '', '2455', '23', '105', '77733', '0', 4, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 13, '', NULL, '4 Bedroom Custom Home. Bahia Soliman', 'This custom home is located on a quiet street along the golf course in a gated community - Puerto Aventuras.\r\nThe property is built on a double lot with a total size of 960 Sq.M. (10.333 sq. ft.) and consists of the main 3-bedroom house and a guest house, that are independent of each other and private. \r\nThe design of the houses was carefully planned so each and every space would give you comfort and joy.\r\nA must see!\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\nâ€¢	Solar panels\r\nâ€¢	Open living space\r\nâ€¢	Double height ceiling\r\nâ€¢	Spacious open kitchen\r\nâ€¢	Laundry room\r\nâ€¢	Beautiful garden \r\nâ€¢	Swimming pool set in the middle of lush nature \r\nâ€¢	Storage room\r\nâ€¢	2 parking spaces', '-87.222745', '20.507081', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 960.00, 'bed', ''),
(408, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'AOTULRAM.FDS', 484.00, 45.00, 0.00, 18, 'Entre Avenida 5 Sur y 13 ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 18, '', NULL, 'Beautiful 1BR Condo Well Ubicated in an Increasing Area', 'Tulum is one of the most emblematic touristic areas in Mexico since it offers a unique experience through the connection with nature. \r\nThe beautiful Maya Ruins, the white sand beaches, and the Turquoise Sea making it one of the most important destinations for Mexicans and foreigners. \r\n\r\nThis project is located a few minutes from downtown, just a mile from the highway that connects Cancun to the International Airport. \r\nOnly 18 units for this beautiful building with a lot of green areas and high-quality materials. \r\n\r\nTop Amenities: \r\n- Two pools, one on the ground floor and another one style sky-pool\r\n- Roof-top with service bar,\r\n- Yoga area\r\n-Stellar terrace with telescope\r\n-Parking\r\n\r\nLAST 1BR PENTHOUSE at 165,000 USD', '-87.47927139029026', '20.201395061157346', 0, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
