(414, 'sold', '', 18, 21, 0, 'GPXPUHAB.FDS', 0.00, 0.00, 6415.00, 0, 'Playa Xpu-Ha', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77734', '104', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 21, '', NULL, 'Amazing Opportunity to Buy a Land in Xpu-Ha !!', 'Xpu-Ha Beach is one of the most famous beaches in the Riviera Maya, its perfect location between Playa Del Carmen (20 minutes) and Tulum (30 minutes) making it a unique investment location.\r\nThis residential complex is located 2km from Xpu-Ha Beach. \r\nIt will be composed of 68 lots (just 15 are still available) between 600 and 650m2. You will have the possibility to built a 2 story home with a roof or just buy the land. \r\n\r\nAmenities: \r\n-Natural green areas\r\n-Clubhouse\r\n-Large pools and terraces\r\n-Tennis and Basketball courts\r\n-Restaurants, BBQ area\r\nSecurity 24/7.\r\n\r\nThe project will have all the services (electricity, water, drainage, and telephone). ', '-87.257972', '20.471765', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 600.00, 'bed', ''),
(415, 'sold', '', 18, 21, 0, 'GPPPPP.FDS', 0.00, 0.00, 3230.00, 0, 'Playa Paamul', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77735', '19', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 21, '', NULL, 'New Opportunity To Invest in Playa Paamul !! Land Only ', 'Playa Paamul is still an exclusive area with very few construction projects, located only 10 minutes from Playa Del Carmen. \r\n\r\nPunta Paraiso is the only beachfront residential development in this area. \r\n\r\nLow-density development with abundant green areas (65%). , Land of 34 hectares totally closed\r\n\r\nAttractive prices per square meter with pre-sale discounts. \r\n\r\n214 lands, 70 still available. \r\n\r\n3 types of lots: lakefront, front of the green areas, or oceanfront. \r\n\r\nMany amenities: \r\n- 2 artificial lake\r\n-Club House\r\n-Beach Club\r\n-Kids Club\r\n-Gym\r\n-Yoga Zone \r\n- Tennis Field\r\n-Jogging & Bike paths\r\n-Restaurants\r\n-Bar, BBQ area\r\n-Pet park\r\n- Security 24/7', '-87.198247', '20.523317', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 300.00, 'bed', ''),
(416, 'sold', '', 18, 21, 0, 'AOTULAUM.FDS', 0.00, 0.00, 5400.00, 0, 'Francisco Uh May', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '122', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 25, '', NULL, 'First Plots of Land available in the Coba region ! ', 'Located in the state of Quintana Roo, Tulum was considered one of the important centers of worship for the Mayan culture. It is currently one of the top tourist attractions worldwide.\r\n\r\nTheses Lots are situated just 14 miles from the center of Tulum, towards the ruins of CobÃ¡, exists a small town called Francisco Uh May.\r\nIt 20 hectares planned community that will conserve 65% of its Jungle.\r\n\r\n117 housing lots in 12 blocks with more than 4 land options in different sizes and designs : \r\nLots of 500 m2: between 55,265-66,727 USD \r\nLots of 625 m2: between 70,222-75,856 USD\r\nLots of 798 m2 : betwwen 95,176-116,675 USD\r\nLots of 1000 m2: between 1212,322-146,312 USD \r\n\r\nWith over 10 unique amenities:\r\n-Infinity jungle pools,\r\n- Jacuzzi\r\n-Cold plunge\r\n-Steams rooms\r\n-Reading areas\r\n-Emblematic bridge with views\r\n-Organic market\r\n-Bike paths\r\n-Pet-friendly areas\r\n-Fitness center\r\n-Yoga area\r\n- Temazcal. ', '-87.590277', '20.364722', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 500.00, 'bed', ''),
(420, 'active', '', 18, 20, 64, 'FDXK.SA', 1918.00, 178.00, 0.00, 0, 'Ximbalkin', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '179', 4, 4, 1, 0, 0, 2007, 13, '', NULL, 'Beautiful 4BR House In Private Community', 'Beautiful house with 4 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms located in a private and safe community.\r\n\r\nSpacious and good naturals lights. \r\n\r\nIdeal for families due to its proximity to schools, supermarkets, hospitals, banks.\r\n\r\nFew minutes from the beach.', '-87.09256450531217', '20.626127100420497', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(421, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 64, 'FD02CU.FDS', 2874.00, 267.00, 0.00, 0, 'Ximbalkin', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '179', 4, 4, 1, 0, 0, 2007, 13, '', NULL, '2-story Home In A Private Gated Community â€˜Ximbalkiinâ€™', 'This great location provides all the modern conveniences the city has to offer just beyond your doorstep - easy access to cafes, shops, supermarkets, cinemas, banks, gym, restaurants, and more!\r\n\r\nThe first level features a living & dining area, kitchen, service room, charming entry room, and a guest bedroom.\r\nAn expansive living area with floor to ceilings windows opens into a private backyard with shade, a refreshing swimming pool, and a cozy outdoor living area. \r\n3 bedrooms plus a second living area upstairs including a master bedroom with a walk-in closet, a beautiful en-suite bathroom with marble finishes, and a private terrace with a recently installed Jacuzzi.\r\nEach room offers an ample closet area, ceiling fan, powerful air conditioning, and en-suite bathrooms.\r\n\r\nA beautiful place for those summer nights of entertaining!\r\n\r\nThis is a perfect vacation getaway or a comfortable permanent residence.', '-87.088186', '20.624952', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
