(446, 'sold', 'LAST UNIT', 18, 20, 62, 'GPTULRZA1.FDS', 1400.00, 130.00, 0.00, 16, 'Calle 12 Sur', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '31', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 2021, 18, '', NULL, 'Beautiful 1BR Penthouse with Private Pool ! ', 'This project has a privileged location in Tulum: Region 15, which borders on the area with the highest added value in the city. This strategic location allows residents to enjoy a lifestyle of the first level, combining easy access to all services, beaches and at the same time enjoy the tranquility and security of living in an exclusive residential area.\r\n\r\nThis project is the third stage of a great Real Estate Development called \"Las Rosas Condos\", made up of 13 condominiums, hotels, and private houses of the highest quality of construction and the architectural\r\ndesign. \r\n\r\nAll units have air conditioning, fans, are fully furnished, and equipped with the Turn Key concept: complete bathroom, with Mediterranean design and excellent quality materials and finishes, ample kitchen and dining space. \r\nThe rooftop includes a pool with a jacuzzi system, kitchen bar, bathroom, and sundeck. \r\n\r\nWith first-class amenities: \r\n- Green areas\r\n- Fully equipped gym\r\n- Solarium\r\n- Common pool on ground floor\r\n- Rooftop with pool\r\n- Kitchen bar\r\n- Common bathrooms', '-87.47147083282472', '20.197100335468825', 0, 0, 0, 1, 10, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
