(464, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'FDSTULW3.FDS', 542.00, 50.00, 0.00, 82, 'Avenida Kukulkan, Esquina XelHa, M32, L1', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 18, '', NULL, 'Good Opportunity To Invest ! Modern Studio - LAST 2 UNITS', 'Tulum is one of the most emblematic touristic areas in Mexico since it offers a unique experience through the connection with nature. \r\nThe beautiful Maya Ruins, the white sand beaches, and the Turquoise Sea making it one of the most important destinations for Mexicans and foreigners.\r\n \r\nThis project is located just 5 minutes from downtown Tulum and tourist attractions.\r\n\r\nA residential resort that tastefully blends luxury condominiums with a retail area that offers residents, guests, and visitors a choice array of services and amenities:\r\n-  2 Pools\r\n- Fitness Center\r\n- Yoga Area, Spa\r\n- Restaurant\r\n- Market\r\n- Kids Club\r\n- Co-working Space\r\n- Laundry\r\n\r\nHowever, this project offers a full hotel service: room cleaning services, room service, and concierge: this condo-hotel is a new form of investment that offers you an attractive return on investment. \r\n\r\nThe future of hospitality eco-hotel is here !!', '-87.466141', '20.199465', 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
(466, 'sold', 'LAST UNIT', 18, 20, 61, 'FDSTULVAK2.FDS', 1108.00, 103.00, 0.00, 12, 'Aldea Zama ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '23', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2021, 18, '', NULL, '2BR Condo With A Tulum Style In a Private Residence ', 'Aldea ZamÃ¡ is a bold step that defines modern life in the Riviera Maya, merging Tulum\'s antiquity and mysticism with contemporary lifestyle and centrally located between the beach and Tulum village.\r\n\r\nThis project is a private and quiet residence of only 12 Villas.\r\nThe building has been oriented to receive the breeze and freshness of the sea from the front, designed so that the prevailing winds enter the front of the building to each of the villas through their balconies.\r\n\r\nBeautiful amenities: \r\n- Solar Heated Pool\r\n- Bbq Area\r\n- Lot of Green Areas\r\n- 24/7 Security \r\n- Elevator\r\n- Vacation Rental Program ', '-87.464691', '20.200457', 0, 0, 0, 1, 7, 0.00, 'bed', '');
