(517, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'FDS-IC-KNA-ACA-01-FDS', 678.00, 68.00, 0.00, 89, 'Avenida Universidades, Carr Cancun-Tulum', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '3', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2023, 18, '', NULL, 'New Lifestyle.1-Bedroom Condo Inside A Private Gated Community', 'Kalena arrives in the Riviera Maya to offer an urban lifestyle that has all the services and amenities in one place. Now you can live in a connected environment that allows you to walk from home to work, to college, or to dinner.\r\n\r\n8 minutes from Playa del Carmen downtown and 1.2 miles from the beach. \r\n\r\nThis first building name Acacia is the first phase of 4 others phases. \r\nAcacia is a set of four 3-level towers in which the residential area is perfectly complemented with retail space. The shops on the ground floor offer essential services that enrich the lives of its residents.\r\n\r\nYou can find: \r\n- 20 retails spaces\r\n- 2 restaurants \r\n- A Pool\r\n- A common laundry room\r\n- Pharmacy\r\n- Social area deck\r\n- A bike path that provides connectivity between the district Kalena\r\nAll the amenities of the district Kalena such as shops, restaurants, hospital, hotel, and university. \r\n\r\nYou have 3 different types of 1BR Condo: \r\nType Finch is a 2-story like loft and a balcony\r\nType Canario has a double balcony \r\nType Canario Terraza has a terrace and balcony\r\n\r\nDon\'t miss this opportunity and contact us! ', '-87.04237880743489', '20.682097991811407', 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
