(598, 'active', '', 18, 20, 64, 'NK-LJ2-V', 1539.00, 143.00, 1657.00, 0, 'La Joya Residencial', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '178', 3, 2, 1, 0, 0, 2015, 13, '', NULL, 'Furnished 3-Bedroom House In La Joya. Move In Ready', 'Located in one of the areas with the highest growth and capital gains in Playa del Carmen.\r\nVery safe and quiet residential with a great variety of amenities such as:\r\nâ€¢	Common swimming pool\r\nâ€¢	Green Areas\r\nâ€¢	Lounge area with palapa\r\nâ€¢	Parking\r\nâ€¢	Controlled access\r\nEasy access to shopping centers, schools, hospitals, banks, supermarkets, car washes, gas stations, stops for public transport, and main avenues.\r\nThe nearest beach is a 10-minute drive away.\r\n\r\n\r\n', '-87.103828', '20.620483', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 154.00, 'bed', ''),
