(602, 'sold', 'Great Opportunity', 18, 20, 61, 'FDS-COB-PDC-FDS', 1400.00, 130.00, 0.00, 0, 'Coco Beach', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '10', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2020, 18, '', NULL, 'Amazing Offer!!! 2 Condos for 1 Price!!! Turnkey !!!', 'Coco Beach is an area with very good entertainment, offering a wide variety of restaurants, bars, cafes, boutiques, not to mention the beach clubs to enjoy the white sand beaches and turquoise sea. \r\n\r\nCoco Beach is the luxury area of Playa Del Carmen, it is located in the middle of the famous 5th Avenue and the beach, ideal for those who do not want to drive a car and prefer to ride a bike. \r\n\r\nThis condo is a great investment, first for the location, but especially the price. It offers the possibility to invest in a 2 bedroom condo and enjoy it or invest in two 1 bedroom condos to be able to live and rent the other part and get a good return on investment. \r\n\r\nIn addition, the building has qualities that today are difficult to find in this area, such as ample spaces, ocean views, parking, storage. \r\nAnd it has good amenities: \r\n\r\n- 2 swimming pools with ocean view\r\n- Gym \r\n- Private pool \r\n\r\nDon\'t hesitate and contact us! \r\n', '-87.06287089046911', '20.637144278623683', 0, 0, 0, 0, 8, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
