(611, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 64, 'SR-LS-V', 7104.00, 660.00, 9578.00, 0, 'Lagos del Sol', '', '2448', '23', '94', '77567', '214', 4, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 13, '', NULL, 'Modern and Elegant 4 Bedroom House In Lagos del Sol', 'Luxury 4 bedrooms, 4.5-bathroom house in Lagos del Sol is ready for your personal touch.\r\n890 m2 of land (corner lot) | 640 m2 of constructions.\r\n\r\nHighlight:\r\nâ€¢	Spacious living and dining room with bar\r\nâ€¢	Bibliotheca\r\nâ€¢	Professional cinema room with seats and Premium sound\r\nâ€¢	Pool table area with bar\r\nâ€¢	Master bedroom with steam room, tub, and walk-in-closet \r\nâ€¢	Playroom for kids\r\nâ€¢	Parking for 9 cars\r\nâ€¢	Service room\r\nâ€¢	Laundry room\r\nâ€¢	Infinity pool\r\nâ€¢	Garden\r\nâ€¢	Luxury finishes throw-out marble, carpentry, etc.\r\nâ€¢	The house has a view of green areas\r\n\r\nLocated within an exclusive gated community just a few minutes away from downtown, Cancun International airport, hotel zone entrance, and exit road to Mayan Riviera. â€“ everything you need is at your fingerprint.\r\n\r\nThe community features extensive green areas (more than 40 hectares), beautiful lakes, and a clubhouse with tennis courts, squash, 3 pools being one of them a 25 m and 6 lanes Semi-Olympic, a gym, multifunctional basketball and volleyball court, a coffee shop, multiple-use salon, steam bath and more.\r\n\r\nThe original price of the house is in Mexican pesos: 25,200,000 MXN', '-86.852953', '21.056730', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 890.00, 'bed', ''),
(612, 'sold', '', 0, 20, 64, 'SR-LS2-V', 3982.00, 370.00, 4284.00, 0, 'Lagos del Sol', '', '2448', '23', '94', '77567', '214', 4, 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, 13, '', NULL, 'Lagos del Sol. 4 Bedroom Home in Exclusive Gated Community', 'The spacious family house is located in one of the most exclusive areas of Cancun. The gated community â€œLagos del Solâ€ is just a few minutes from downtown, from the airport, hotel zone entrance, and the exit road to Riviera Maya. The community has a 24/7 security system, and almost 50% of the project is dedicated to green areas and the Lakeside. All the green areas are surrounded by Bike Path. The Club House has a tennis court, squash, 3 swimming pools, a gym, basketball, and volleyball. Rooms for special events.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\nâ€¢	Large swimming pool in the backyard patio\r\nâ€¢	Green areas\r\nâ€¢	High ceilings, helping the rooms keep cool\r\nâ€¢	Breathtaking view from the rooftop to the surrounding forest. \r\nâ€¢	The house is located on the corner, which gives you only 1 neighbor\r\nâ€¢	2 pacing spots for cars \r\n\r\nThe original price of the house is in Mexican pesos: 8,200,000 mxn', '-86.8529531', '21.05673', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 398.00, 'bed', ''),
(613, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 64, 'SR-AC-V', 5382.00, 500.00, 10010.00, 0, 'Av Alamos', '', '2448', '23', '94', '77533', '211', 6, 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, 22, '', NULL, '6 Bedroom House In The Center - Av. Alamos', 'Speciose house on a double lot offers 5,381 square feet of versatile living space in a desirable split plan with three bedrooms and three and a half baths, office, laundry room on the ground floor, and 2 bedrooms on the second level. This home comes with white cabinets, tile in the living and dining areas, cabinets made of wood, and stretch ceilings. The spacious island kitchen blends seamlessly with the family room and formal dining, flooded with light from large glass sliders leading to the private garden. A master suite features an ample closet, dual sinks, and a large shower. This home is complete with a 4-car garage. \r\nGreat location at the entrance of Cancun, just a few minute\'s drive from the airport, downtown, Anahuac Cancun university, big malls, and the main attractions of Cancun.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\nâ€¢	The big garden (10,010 Sq.Ft.) offers enough space to install a swimming pool.\r\nâ€¢	A great option for investors â€“ easy to turn the house for business purposes.\r\n\r\nThe original price of the house is in Mexican pesos: 6,200,000 mxn', '-86.83962856451154', '21.115769749865674', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 968.00, 'bed', ''),
(614, 'sold', '', 18, 21, 0, 'SR-CL-V', 0.00, 0.00, 2368.00, 0, '5th Av & 56 St', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '4', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'Commercial Land On 5th Avenue. Corner Lot', 'Land for commercial or apartment mix on the 5th Avenue is offered for sale.\r\nCorner lot.\r\nGreat potential.', '-87.062616', '20.639571', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 220.00, 'bed', ''),
(615, 'active', '', 18, 3, 68, 'SR-ELS-V', 6458.00, 600.00, 2368.00, 0, 'Colosio 5th Avenue', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77728', '5', 9, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'Eco Boutique Hotel Less Than 400 Meters Away From The Beach', 'This boutique hotel is located on the peaceful and quiet side of 5th Avenue.\r\nâ€¢	Neighborhood local restaurants, Fruit/Vegetable market, and 24-Hour store are less than 5 minutes walk.\r\nâ€¢	Amazing rooftop infinity pool with views of the turquoise blue waters of the Mexican Caribbean over lush green trees.\r\nâ€¢	Punta Esmeralda with its clean white sandy beaches and turquoise waters is less than 400 meters away.\r\n\r\nEach suite is carefully designed for comfort. Combination decor and atmosphere with modern Ecotechnology. All beds, patio, and pool furniture are hand-made by Mayans with local solid hardwood.\r\nAn Eco-Friendly property with Solar panels. Hot water tanks are European designs with hot water on demand.', '-87.06053495407106', '20.64263985065196', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 220.00, 'bed', ''),
(616, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 64, 'FG-PLC2-V', 6028.00, 560.00, 4316.00, 0, 'Paseo Xaman-Ha', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '1', 4, 4, 1, 0, 0, 2023, 13, '', NULL, 'Custom House With Prime Location.  Financing available', 'Great opportunity to purchase a custom house in Playacar Phase 2 with a prime location!\r\n\r\nEasy access to the beach â€“ 5 minutesâ€™ walk; 10 minutes walk to â€œPlaza Playacarâ€ with its shops, atm, cafes and just 20-minute away from downtown of Playa del Carmen.\r\nThis spectacular villa with a contemporary design is ready for your personal touch.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\nâ€¢	Luxury finishes\r\nâ€¢	Professional cinema room/game room\r\nâ€¢	4 bedrooms \r\nâ€¢	Spacious master bedroom with two walk-in closets and a balcony.\r\nâ€¢	Gym\r\nâ€¢	Infinity pool\r\nâ€¢	Sunbathing area with barbecue area\r\nâ€¢	Private garden\r\nâ€¢	Double height lobby\r\nâ€¢	Parking for 2 cars\r\nâ€¢	Service area & laundry\r\n\r\nFinancing available*\r\nThe original price of the house is in Mexican pesos: 19,600,000mxn', '-87.08516413836797', '20.61327599126563', 0, 0, 0, 0, 4, 401.00, 'bed', ''),
(617, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'NK-PC-V', 670.00, 62.00, 0.00, 0, '24 St between 10 Av & 5 Av', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '16', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, '24 St between 10Av & 5AV. Great place to live or vacation.', 'Great location & first-class amenities make this project a great investment opportunity!\r\n24 st. between 5th and 10th Av. â€“ is a great place to live or vacation.\r\nEasy access to everything - beach (3 blocks), GYM (next door), Stadion Mario Villanueva Madrid (3 blocks), Stores, Supermarkets. Surrounded by restaurants, cafes & bars.\r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢	Rooftop pool\r\nâ€¢	Sun deck\r\nâ€¢	Bar area\r\nâ€¢	GYM\r\nâ€¢	Elevator\r\nâ€¢	Underground parking\r\nâ€¢	Lobby\r\nâ€¢	Wi-Fi\r\n', '-87.06935826388562', '20.631898661026053', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(618, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 61, 'DH-SC4-V', 1614.50, 150.00, 0.00, 0, 'Calle Agua Smz 4 ', '', '2448', '23', '94', '77500', '211', 3, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 22, '', NULL, '3 Bedroom Condo In The Center. View Of The Park', 'Modern apartments in the center of Cancun - ready for your personal touch.\r\nA 3-bedroom condo in Sosta Residential is only 5 minutes from the beach.\r\nWalking distance to the park and Plaza las Americas with over 100 stores, a cinema complex, a gym, and a supermarket.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\nâ€¢ Beautiful Park view\r\nâ€¢ Two parking spaces are available per apartment.\r\nâ€¢ Rooftop pool with swimming pool\r\nâ€¢ Hurricane shutters\r\nâ€¢ Keypad controlled gate, security cameras, and electric garage doors\r\nâ€¢ Central location in Avenida Tulum\r\n\r\n4th floor | 3br | 150 m2\r\nUnfurnished\r\nThe original price of the condo is in Mexican pesos: 5,900,000mxn', '-86.824027', '21.153920', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(620, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 64, 'VD-V', 2798.00, 260.00, 3756.00, 0, 'Region 15', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '31', 4, 3, 1, 0, 0, 2019, 18, '', NULL, 'Luxury House in Tulum\'s Desirable Region 15 - Perfect for Living or Investing!', 'Whether you are looking for a place to live in one of the most beautiful destinations in the world or a profitable venture in the vacation rental market, this house offers the best of both worlds.\r\n\r\nThe house is located in the desirable Region 15 of Tulum ensures easy access to all the local attractions, including world-class beaches, restaurants, and shopping. The demand for vacation rentals in the area is expected to continue to grow in the coming years.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, It has a proven track record of generating significant rental income through vacation rentals, making it an attractive investment opportunity for those lookingfor those looking for a passive income stream. With its greatamenities, prime location, and high-quality construction and finishes, the house is in high demand among tourists and vacationers, ensuring ongoing rental income for its owners.\r\n\r\nThe house is sold with brand new furniture, electronic and home appliances.', '-87.469025', '20.181302', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 349.00, 'bed', ''),
(621, 'sold', '', 18, 20, 64, 'VD-1-V', 2594.00, 241.00, 3412.00, 0, 'Region 15', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '31', 3, 3, 1, 0, 0, 2018, 18, '', NULL, '3-Bedroom House. Fully Furnished & Equipped', 'The house is sold with brand new furniture, electronic and home appliances.\r\nFirst floor: a master bedroom with an ensuite full bathroom and a balcony, a completely fitted kitchen, and laundry, a beautiful living room with a swimming pool view, and one-half bathroom.\r\nSecond floor: a master bedroom with king-size bed, ensuite full bathroom and balcony, guests bedroom with 2 full-size beds and an ensuite full bathroom, and a spacious family TV room.\r\n\r\n*Part of the swimming pool enters the living room under the stairs and through an enormous window, bringing freshness and Zen design to the space.\r\nAdditional:\r\nElectric fence, cameras, alarm system.\r\nThe best quality materials (in floors, kitchen, bathrooms, and exteriors including steel structures).', '-87.46885317956163', '20.180666074901062', 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 317.00, 'bed', ''),
