(674, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'TSM0-V', 341.60, 31.74, 0.00, 0, '44th St & 1st Ave', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '10', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2019, 18, '', NULL, 'Prime Investment Opportunity In Playa del Carmen. Turn-key Studio In The Shore ', 'Investment Opportunity in Playa del Carmen! Studio for sale in Menesse \"The Shore\" on 44th St & 1st Ave. Fully furnished & equipped, 31.74 sq.m. \r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢ Rooftop with ocean view\r\nâ€¢ Swimming pool\r\nâ€¢ Bar\r\nâ€¢ Gym\r\nâ€¢ Underground parking\r\nâ€¢ Lobby\r\nâ€¢ Elevator\r\nâ€¢ Co-working room\r\n \r\nPrime location near beaches, restaurants, and shops. Don\'t miss this chance to own a piece of paradise in a thriving coastal destination. Contact us now!', '-87.0638084', '20.6370105', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
(675, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'CRS0-V', 538.00, 50.00, 0.00, 0, '', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77600', '31', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 15, '', NULL, 'New On The Market | Take Advantage Of the Friends & Family price!', 'Introducing a new project: Studio Condos for sale in Tulum, Region 15. \r\nTake advantage of the Friends & Family price!\r\n\r\nThese contemporary studio condos offer style, functionality, and luxury in one of Mexico\'s most desirable destinations. With a generous 50 m2 of living space, these condos provide a well-designed layout for comfortable living. \r\n\r\nThe delivery is scheduled for July 2024.\r\nFurniture packages are available.', '-87.4706576922563', '20.185604416775345', 1, 0, 0, 1, 7, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
(736, 'active', '', 19, 20, 62, 'CMKLM-3-V', 2820.00, 262.00, 0.00, 0, 'Calle Diagonal 85 Sur', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '231', 3, 3, 0, 0, 0, 2025, 18, '', NULL, 'A rare find: 3-Bedroom Penthouse covering the towerâ€™s top two floors, 262 mÂ².', 'Discover this modern, low-density residential community offering comfort and style in one of the most sought-after areas of Playa del Carmen.\r\n\r\nThis growing neighborhood provides great convenience with easy access to shopping, dining, entertainment, and essential services. It is well-connected, close to the beach and downtown, offering the perfect balance between urban living and coastal relaxation.\r\n\r\nThe project features only 39 units across 9 towers, providing privacy and a peaceful atmosphereâ€”ideal for living, vacationing, or investingâ€”spread over more than 3,000 mÂ² of land.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nâ€¢ Modern design with spacious layouts\r\nâ€¢ Amenities: rooftop infinity pool, lounge, cinema, yoga & meditation area; ground-floor pool, gym, spa, coworking space, laundry, and more\r\nâ€¢ Underground utilities and secure access\r\nâ€¢ 1, 2, and 3-bedroom units, including lock-off and penthouse options\r\nâ€¢ Delivery scheduled for December 2025.\r\nâ€¢ Bank financing available.\r\n\r\nPerfect for living or generating rental income in one of Playaâ€™s fastest-growing neighborhoods.\r\nContact us for availability and details!\r\n\r\nNote: The original price is in Mexican pesos â€“ 10,607,519 . The price in USD may vary depending on the current exchange rate.\r\n', '-87.098795', '20.622406', 1, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(669, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'VBAGST', 462.00, 43.00, 0.00, 46, 'Av. 10 entre Calle 8 & 10', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '121', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2023, 18, '', NULL, 'Vacation, Live, or Rent â€“ 1-Bedroom in Playa del Carmen.', 'Choose your 1-bedroom condo from the different floor plans this project offers. Perfect for living, vacationing, or generating rental income â€” it features thoughtful design, great amenities, and is located just steps from the beach.\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\nâ€¢ 1 bedroom / 1 bath\r\nâ€¢ Modern finishes and open layout\r\nâ€¢ Balcony to enjoy the Caribbean breeze\r\nâ€¢ Rooftop pool with ocean views, gym, coworking space, yoga area, jacuzzi, and more\r\nâ€¢ 100 m from 5th Avenue and 200 m from the beach\r\nâ€¢ Delivery: Summer 2025\r\n\r\nNote: The images are from a model unit. All condos are delivered equipped but not furnished.\r\n\r\nContact us for more information!', '', '', 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.00, 'bed', 'Summer'),
(670, 'sold', 'New Development', 18, 20, 0, 'DDFG1B', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'Av Punta Brava, Cruz De Servicios Playa del Carmen', '', '1810', '23', '25', '', '0', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 18, '', NULL, 'New 1 Bedroom Condo in Playa\'s New Downtown Area', '1 Bedroom Apartment located in the new downtown of Playa del Carmen, away from the buzz of 5th Avenue, this luxury condominium has everything you need to relax, it`s located close to Plaza las Americas, restaurants, supermarkets and lots of services. \r\n\r\nâ€¢ Green Areas \r\nâ€¢ Pool\r\nâ€¢ Sun Tanning Area\r\nâ€¢ Gym\r\nâ€¢ Kids Room \r\nâ€¢ Playground\r\nâ€¢ Pet park\r\nâ€¢ Jogging Track\r\nâ€¢ Bike park\r\nâ€¢ Parking\r\nâ€¢ Deli bar\r\nâ€¢ Dining + Grill\r\n\r\n', '-87.464479', '20.652081', 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(678, 'active', '', 18, 21, 0, 'ANMH-V', 0.00, 0.00, 113946.00, 0, '', '', '2450', '23', '96', 'ANMH-V', '155', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 21, '', NULL, 'Pristine Beachfront Land Parcel In Mahahual.', 'Discover a captivating opportunity to own a pristine beachfront land parcel in Mahahual, an idyllic coastal destination located 1 hour north of the town. \r\n\r\nThis property spans 10,586 m2, with 85 m of exclusive beachfront, offering unparalleled views of the crystalline turquoise waters of the Caribbean Sea.\r\nLocated within a tranquil and secluded area, this property provides a serene and private escape.\r\n\r\nAll documentation is in order. \r\n* No utilities \r\n\r\nThe original price is in Mexican pesos: 13,000,000 MXN.', '-87.55099060580814', '19.101134013913985', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10586.00, 'bed', ''),
(679, 'active', '', 18, 20, 64, 'AVS2B-V', 1970.00, 183.00, 0.00, 0, 'Region 11', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '28', 2, 2, 1, 0, 0, 2023, 13, '', NULL, 'Luxe Eco Villas Located In Uptown Tulum | Villa Sol, Amari.', 'Amari is a sustainable jungle community of high-end luxury villas located in the uptown Tulum. New roads, underground services including sewage and city planning will provide a more complete lifestyle here in Tulum while holding better value as time goes on, as the area is being developed all around. Amari offers one of the strongest Roi\'s and the best price per sq. ft. in the Region.\r\nThe Amenities Center is designed to create a great environment for its residents and guests where you can get most of your needs met within the gated community.\r\n\r\nAmari offers all  owners free transportation in private suburbans anywhere within a 20 mile radius - this will include pickups at the new Tulum Airport.\r\n\r\n4 different villa designs from 2 to 4 bedrooms each with private pool and lux finishes (from 399,900 USD to 559,900 USD).\r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢ Swimming pool & Solarium\r\nâ€¢ Wellness & Temazcal \r\nâ€¢ Jungle Gym &  Yoga Platform\r\nâ€¢ Restaurant bar \r\nâ€¢ Security 24/7\r\nâ€¢ Parking\r\nâ€¢ Luxury Transportation Service for residents & guests\r\nâ€¢ Water Filtration System \r\nâ€¢ SMART HOME & 500Mbs INTERNET\r\n\r\nThe layout of the master plan saves over 50% of existing trees, preserving the identity of Tulum and providing interior spaces with views towards jungle gardens, patios, green corridors and water elements.', '-87.4861077244661', '20.21726086541195', 1, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
