(686, 'active', '', 18, 3, 44, 'MPLA-V', 742.00, 69.00, 0.00, 0, 'Av. Tulum', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', 'Av. Tulum', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 2, '', NULL, 'Commercial spaces located in Tulumâ€™s Main Avenue.', 'New commercial development located in Tulumâ€™s Main Avenue.\r\nCommercial spaces from 69 m2 up to 870 m2.\r\nUp to 10% discount.', '-87.478809', '20.206467', 1, 0, 0, 0, 12, NULL, 'bed', ''),
(687, 'active', '', 18, 3, 44, 'MPLA-V8', 947.00, 88.00, 0.00, 0, 'Av. Tulum', '', '1811', '23', '0', '77760', '0', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 2, '', NULL, 'Profit from Paradise: Invest in Tulum\'s Main Avenue with Attractive Discounts on Commercial Spaces', 'Investment Opportunity: new commercial development located in Tulumâ€™s Main Avenue. Range of spaces from 69 m2 to 870 m2. Up to 10% discount. Prime location with high foot traffic and attractive aesthetics.\r\n\r\nThe price is 4,840,000 MXN. The price in USD may vary according to the exchange rate.\r\n\r\nContact us for more information.', '-87.47837760541387', '20.20662888294829', 1, 0, 0, 0, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(688, 'active', '', 18, 3, 44, 'MPLA-V4', 4671.00, 434.00, 0.00, 0, 'Av. Tulum', '', '1811', '23', '0', '77760', '0', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 2, '', NULL, 'Maximize Your ROI: Exclusive Offer on Commercial Spaces in Tulum\'s Main Avenue..', 'Discover a great investment opportunity in Tulum\'s Main Avenue. With booming economic growth and a surge in tourism, this prime location offers investors a chance to capitalize on the thriving market in one of Mexico\'s most sought-after destinations.\r\n\r\nChoose from a range of commercial spaces, spanning 69 m2 to 870 m2, catering to diverse business needs. Early investors can benefit from an enticing up to 10% discount, enhancing the potential return on investment and maximizing profitability. Don\'t miss this limited-time offer to secure prime commercial real estate at a discounted price, setting the stage for long-term success.\r\n\r\nThe price is 19,530,000 MXN. The price in USD may vary according to the exchange rate.', '-87.478248', '20.206427', 1, 0, 0, 0, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(689, 'active', '', 18, 3, 39, 'MPLA-V7', 9009.00, 873.00, 0.00, 0, 'Av. Tulum', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', 'Av. Tulum', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 2, '', NULL, 'Prime Commercial Space of 870 m2 in Tulum\'s Main Avenue. ', 'Located in a prime area, this project offers investors the potential to capitalize on the growing economic activity and tourism boom in Tulum, one of Mexico\'s most sought-after destinations.\r\n\r\nThe centerpiece of this opportunity is a generous commercial space spanning 870 m2, providing ample room for businesses to establish themselves and thrive. With its sizable dimensions, investors have the freedom to create a remarkable establishment that aligns perfectly with their vision and investment goals.\r\n\r\nThe price is 48,015,000 MXN. The price in USD may vary according to the exchange rate.\r\n\r\nUp to 10% discount for early investors.', '-87.47833342826493', '20.206548334854617', 1, 0, 0, 0, 12, NULL, 'bed', ''),
(690, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'MUCV-V', 1338.00, 124.00, 0.00, 0, 'St. 12 Sur', '', '1811', '23', '0', '77760', '0', 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', NULL, 'Turnkey 1-Bedroom Condo In A Boutique Complex In La Veleta.  Immediate Delivery .', '1-Bedroom Condo In A Boutique Complex In La Veleta. Only 6 units, privacy and tranquility are assured.  Immediate delivery. Turn-key.\r\n\r\nOne of the highlights of this stunning condo is the beautiful garden with a private pool and terrace spanning an impressive 52.4 m2. \r\n\r\nModern design, with high-quality finishes and tasteful decor. \r\nThe open floor plan maximizes natural light, creating an inviting atmosphere throughout the living areas. Large windows frame picturesque views of the garden, bringing the beauty of nature indoors. Every detail has been carefully considered to provide you with a comfortable and convenient lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe condo comes with a laundry room & parking space.\r\nAmenities: Private pool, lounge areas, parking.\r\n\r\nThe price is 4,380,000 MXN. The price in USD may vary according to the exchange rate.', '-87.473530', '20.200406', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', '');
