(691, 'active', '', 18, 21, 0, 'N1011-V', 0.00, 0.00, 3616.60, 0, 'Nido 101', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '225', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 16, '', NULL, 'Don\'t Miss Out! Exclusive Resale Opportunity in Nido 101', 'Tulum 101 - the newest area of Tulum, named after the 101 hectares of land it encompasses, this new project is dedicated to upscale living, sustainability, and preserving nature.\r\n\r\nLocated between Aldea Zama and the Tulum Hotel Zone,  offering its residents the advantage of living near both the ocean and the most important street in Tulum: Av CobÃ¡.\r\n\r\nNido 101 is one of the first projects located within Tulum 101. The luxury gated community of  85 single-family lots is seamlessly interwoven with the captivating beauty of the jungle.\r\nFirst-class amenities, a monumental entrance, a pool/cenote and trails surrounded by deep vegetation, and more!\r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢ Security 24/7\r\nâ€¢ Controlled access\r\nâ€¢ Wellness pavilion\r\nâ€¢ Fitness pavilion\r\nâ€¢ Landscaped green areas\r\nâ€¢ Walking trails\r\nâ€¢ Natural cenote pool\r\nâ€¢ Grill zone\r\n\r\nThis resale lot is a premium corner unit of 336 mÂ², offering greater privacy, added value, and versatile design options for your future home. Since the project is already sold out, it represents a rare opportunity to own property in one of the most sought-after areas of Tulum.\r\n\r\nLot services include water, municipal sewage, underground electrical network, and fiber optics.\r\n\r\nReady to build.', '-87.44773924125141', '20.1891489700916', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 336.57, 'bed', ''),
(692, 'active', '', 0, 21, 0, 'N10134-V', 0.00, 0.00, 5381.00, 0, 'Nido 101', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '225', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 16, '', NULL, 'Nido 101: Exceptional Value, Priced Below Market Rates!', 'Tulum 101 - the newest area of Tulum, named after the 101 hectares of land it encompasses, this new project is dedicated to upscale living, sustainability, and preserving nature.\r\n\r\nLocated between Aldea Zama and the Tulum Hotel Zone,  offering its residents the advantage of living near both the ocean and the most important street in Tulum: Av CobÃ¡.\r\n\r\nNido 101 is one of the first projects located within Tulum 101. The luxury gated community of  85 single-family lots is seamlessly interwoven with the captivating beauty of the jungle.\r\nFirst-class amenities, a monumental entrance, a pool/cenote and trails surrounded by deep vegetation, and more!\r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢ Security 24/7\r\nâ€¢ Controlled access\r\nâ€¢ Wellness pavilion\r\nâ€¢ Fitness pavilion\r\nâ€¢ Landscaped green areas\r\nâ€¢ Walking trails\r\nâ€¢ Natural cenote pool\r\nâ€¢ Grill zone\r\n\r\nServices of the lots will include water, municipal sewage, subway electrical network, and fiber optics.\r\nDelivery date of the project: winter 2024.\r\n', '-87.44898514700408', '20.1889878557809', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 500.00, 'bed', ''),
(693, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'MHST-V', 538.00, 50.00, 0.00, 0, 'Beachfront', '', '2450', '23', '96', '77976', '155', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 21, '', NULL, 'Beachfront Pre-sale Condos in Mahahual.', 'New beachfront project in Mahahual of 16 condos - designed to provide maximum comfort and luxury to its residents and guests. \r\n\r\nHighlights of the project:\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Privileged location - just minutes away from the Costa Maya. This project is facing the Caribbean Sea, surrounded by convenient services and delightful spots to explore.\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Contemporary design and high-end finishes. The condos are delivered equipped & furnished.\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Exclusive amenities: Enjoy the yoga area overlooking the sea, the infinity pool to cool off at any time, the rooftop with BBQ to organize outdoor gatherings and direct access to the beach to relax and enjoy the beautiful white sand beaches.\r\n\r\nDelivery date: December 2024\r\nThe price is 3,997,500 MXN. The price in USD may vary according to the exchange rate.', '-87.7104447540267', '18.71299006935702', 1, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'studio', ''),
(694, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, '77976', 549.00, 51.00, 0.00, 0, 'Beachfront', '', '2450', '23', '96', '77976', '155', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 24, '', NULL, 'Pre-sale Condos with Direct Beach Access in Mahahual', 'New beachfront project in Mahahual of 16 condos - designed to provide maximum comfort and luxury to its residents and guests. \r\n\r\nHighlights of the project:\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Privileged location - just minutes away from the Costa Maya. This project is facing the Caribbean Sea, surrounded by convenient services and delightful spots to explore.\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Contemporary design and high-end finishes. The condos are delivered equipped & furnished.\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Exclusive amenities: Enjoy the yoga area overlooking the sea, the infinity pool to cool off at any time, the rooftop with BBQ to organize outdoor gatherings and direct access to the beach to relax and enjoy the beautiful white sand beaches.\r\n\r\nDelivery date: December 2024\r\n\r\nThe price is  4,192,500 MXN. The price in USD may vary according to the exchange rate.', '-87.7104447540267', '18.71299006935702', 1, 0, 0, 1, 12, NULL, 'bed', ''),
(695, 'active', '', 18, 20, 64, 'MM3-V', 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0, 'La Veleta', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 3, 3, 1, 0, 0, 2022, 18, '', NULL, 'Brand New Townhouse In La Veleta - Perfect for Living or Investment.', 'Brand new Tulum townhouse, where modern and boho chic styles create a comfortable living space.  Built in 2022.\r\nLocated in Veleta, right in the corner Calle 5 and Calle 6, a block away from Calle 7 with its diverse restaurant options.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nâ€¢ Gated area w/a security guard\r\nâ€¢ Private parking\r\nâ€¢ 3 bedrooms with private bathrooms\r\nâ€¢ Jacuzzi\r\nâ€¢ BBQ\r\nâ€¢ Fully equipped kitchen\r\nâ€¢ Fully equipped laundry.\r\nâ€¢ High speed internet\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\n3 blocks from the main road to downtown Tulum.\r\n15-minute drive to the Tulum strip and the beach.\r\n\r\nThe price is 6,500,000 MXN. The price in USD may vary according to the exchange rate.\r\nThis townhouse offers a comfortable and convenient lifestyle in the heart of Tulum, making it an excellent choice for living or investment.', '-87.477071', '20.203044', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(696, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'SK106', 829.00, 77.00, 0.00, 0, 'Sky Condos', '', '1811', '23', '0', '77760', '0', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'Turn-key 2-Bedroom Condo in La Veleta with a Private Jacuzzi.', 'A lovely 2-bedroom condo on the first floor, complete with a private Jacuzzi.  This ready-to-move property offers a cozy living space with a well-equipped kitchen and dining area.\r\nThe complex has fantastic amenities, including a pool, sky bar, gym, and outdoor cinema, while nearby, you\'ll find resturants, cafes, and local shops. The Holistika Center is just a 10-minute walk away, and the beach is a 13-minute drive from the property.\r\n\r\nAmenities: Infinity swimming pool on the rooftop, sky bar, lounge area, gym, outdoor cinema,  laundry room, elevator, 24-hour security.\r\n\r\nThe price is 4,250,000 MXN. The price in USD may vary according to the exchange rate.', '-87.477822', '20.197869', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(697, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'CLT202', 581.00, 54.00, 0.00, 0, 'Region 15', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '31', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2023, 18, '', NULL, 'Immediate Delivery 1-Bedroom Condo with Amenities.', '1-Bedroom Condo in a boutique complex with only 10 condos.\r\nLocation: Region 15. 7 blocks away from Av. Kukulkan and Aldea Zama.\r\n4min away from Downtown. 12min away from the beach and Tulum Ruins.\r\nImmediate delivery. \r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢ Roof Top\r\nâ€¢ Infinity Pool\r\nâ€¢ Laundry\r\nâ€¢ Private Storage room\r\n\r\nSpecial price: $2,950,000 MXN. \r\n\r\nAccept bank credit. \r\nThe Regiment is ready.', '-87.47421711796073', '20.19792944804528', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(700, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'LNPDC2-V', 968.00, 90.00, 0.00, 0, '26th St. between Av. 20 & Av. 10', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '121', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 18, '', NULL, 'Stylish Beachside Living in Playa del Carmen.', 'Discover 16 beautifully designed apartments in a prime Playa del Carmen location, just minutes from the beach. These apartments redefine coastal living, combining luxury with comfort and practicality.\r\n\r\nThe last four units are available for sale with the project, starting at $345,000 USD and going up to $365,000 USD, depending on the floor.\r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢ Rooftop pool\r\nâ€¢ Sun-lounging deck,\r\nâ€¢ Co-working facility\r\nâ€¢ Spacious wellness yoga area.', '-87.071070', '20.633346', 1, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
