(703, 'active', '', 18, 20, 63, 'SR152-V', 1421.00, 132.00, 1141.00, 0, 'Region 15', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '31', 2, 2, 1, 0, 0, 2024, 15, '', NULL, 'Gated Community with 54 Exclusive Residences in Tulum\'s Region 15.', 'Gated community of 54 exclusive residences in Region 15, Tulum. A project that offers well-designed spaces within the natural environment while preserving endemic vegetation.\r\n\r\nThis development provides security, exclusivity, privacy, and comfort in an atmosphere deeply respectful of nature.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the project is a range of amenities, including lush gardens, a tropical pool, jacuzzi, hammocks, gym, yoga area, pet garden, Palapa Club, and a kids\' area. All common areas are connected by winding pathways to coexist harmoniously with nature. Other project features include a reception, parking, and 24/7 security.\r\n\r\n3 types of residences - choose your perfect place:\r\nâ€¢ 2-bedroom lock-off with a private pool (2 levels) \r\nâ€¢ 2-bedroom lock-off with 2 private pools (3 levels)\r\nâ€¢ 3-bedroom lock-off with 2 pools (3 levels) \r\n\r\nEnjoy discounts depending on the downpayment.', '-87.47262771626527', '20.181173611761103', 1, 0, 0, 1, 5, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
