(731, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'PDCAN1-V', 581.00, 54.00, 0.00, 0, 'Calle 20 con Av. 100', '', '1810', '23', '25', '77710', '14', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2025, 18, '', NULL, 'Brand-New 1-Bed Condo in Playa del Carmen', 'Own a brand-new 1-bedroom condo at an unbeatable price of MXN 1,750,000â€”perfect for first-time buyers or savvy investors.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nâ€¢ 1 bedroom / 1 bath in 54 mÂ² of well-planned living space\r\nâ€¢ Parking space included\r\nâ€¢ Complex of 8 units spread over 3 floors\r\nâ€¢ 90% completeâ€”ready for bank financing (bank credit applicable)\r\nâ€¢ Equipped but unfurnishedâ€”showroom photos in the ad illustrate your future dÃ©cor possibilities\r\nâ€¢ Personalize with your own finishes and style\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nSituated on 20th Street at the corner of 100th Avenue in the Ejido neighborhood.\r\n6-minute drive to Plaza las AmÃ©ricas (shops, cafÃ©s, cinema, and gym).\r\n10-minute drive to Fifth Avenue and the beach.\r\n\r\nNote: The building does not have a swimming pool.\r\nPrice listed in Mexican pesos; equivalent in USD may vary according to today\'s exchange rate.', '', '', 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(707, 'active', 'Luxury Beachfront Residence', 19, 20, 61, 'AGPMN2BBF', 463.91, 141.40, 0.00, 14, '', '', '2440', '23', '0', '77540', '0', 2, 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'Luxury Beachfront Residence', 'Discover a luxurious 2-bedroom beachfront condominium in Puerto Morelos, boasting stunning ocean views and top-tier amenities, including rooftop infinity and beachfront pools, a gym, pet area, and 24/7 security. These spacious condos offer a serene escape for families and couples. Enjoy the convenience of on-site parking and a stylish lobby with a concierge.\r\n\r\nDescubra un lujoso condominio de 2 recÃ¡maras frente al mar en Puerto Morelos, que cuenta con impresionantes vistas al mar y comodidades de primer nivel, que incluyen piscinas infinitas en la azotea y frente al mar, un gimnasio, Ã¡rea para mascotas y seguridad las 24 horas, los 7 dÃ­as de la semana. Estos espaciosos condominios ofrecen un escape sereno para familias y parejas. Disfrute de la comodidad del estacionamiento en el lugar y de un elegante lobby con conserje.', '', '', 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
