(715, 'active', '', 18, 20, 62, 'LPPH-V', 1746.00, 162.00, 0.00, 0, 'Sirenis', '', '2444', '23', '87', '77734', '0', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 13, '', NULL, '2-Bedroom Penthouse In Sirenis. Partial Sea View From The Rooftop.', '2-bedroom penthouse in Sirenis ready for your personal touch.\r\n\r\nHighlights of the property:\r\nâ€¢ 2 levels\r\nâ€¢ Spacious rooms\r\nâ€¢ Balcony\r\nâ€¢ Private jacuzzi\r\nâ€¢ Partial Sea View From The Rooftop.\r\nâ€¢ Service room\r\nâ€¢ Assigned parking\r\n\r\nThe penthouse is equipped with kitchen cabinets, a stove & oven, air conditioning, and ceiling fans.\r\nInterior: 99.65 m2 / Balcony: 16.58 m2 / Rooftop: 45.99 m2 / Parking Space: 12 m2.\r\n\r\nAmenities: Parking, Elevator, Lounge area, Swimming pool on the ground floor, Gym, Jacuzzi on the rooftop.', '-87.298994', '20.428782', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
