(717, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'SIH2-V', 1010.00, 93.87, 0.00, 0, 'Street Calamar', '', '2446', '23', '92', '77310', '229', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2025, 19, '', NULL, 'Escape to Holbox: Introducing 20 Exclusive Units in the Mexican Caribbean.', 'Introducing a new project on the island of Holbox in the Mexican Caribbean. Holbox is known for its stunning white sand beaches, clear waters, and vibrant wildlife, making it a perfect getaway.\r\n\r\nThis boutique complex offers 20 units, including loft-style condos, 1- & 2-bedroom condos, and 2-bedroom penthouses. \r\n\r\nEach unit has a private swimming pool, terrace, and modern interiors adorned with natural materials.\r\nTurnkey ready, the residences are designed to be bathed in natural light, providing an airy and inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nEnjoy amenities like:\r\nâ€¢ Infinity pool\r\nâ€¢ Cafeteria\r\nâ€¢ Jacuzzi\r\nâ€¢ Reception\r\nâ€¢ Sun deck\r\n\r\nYour ideal island retreat awaits!\r\n', '-87.39265645675336', '21.513029292927232', 0, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
