(719, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'SIH2PH-V', 1614.50, 150.00, 0.00, 0, 'Street Calamar', '', '2446', '23', '92', '77310', '229', 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2025, 19, '', NULL, 'Seaside Living: Holbox\'s Boutique Complex. 2-Bedroom Penthouses.', 'Introducing a new project on the island of Holbox in the Mexican Caribbean. Holbox is known for its stunning white sand beaches, clear waters, and vibrant wildlife, making it a perfect getaway.\r\n\r\nThis boutique complex offers 20 units, including loft-style condos, 1- & 2-bedroom condos, and 2-bedroom penthouses. \r\n\r\nEach unit has a private swimming pool, terrace, and modern interiors adorned with natural materials.\r\nTurnkey ready, the residences are designed to be bathed in natural light, providing an airy and inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nEnjoy amenities like:\r\nâ€¢ Infinity pool\r\nâ€¢ Cafeteria\r\nâ€¢ Jacuzzi\r\nâ€¢ Reception\r\nâ€¢ Sun deck\r\n\r\nYour ideal island retreat awaits!', '-87.392656', '21.513029', 0, 0, 0, 1, 12, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(720, 'active', '', 18, 21, 0, 'SR-ELP-V', 0.00, 0.00, 4305.56, 0, 'El Placer', '', '2450', '23', '96', '77977', '172', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 26, '', NULL, 'Beach Lot North of Mahajual | 400m2 | Financing From The Owner Available.', 'Beachfront titled residential land in El Placer (North of Mahahual). 9,9m of beachfront.\r\nAccess to the road. CFE is right behind the land on the road.\r\n\r\nFinancing from the owner available. The price is in US dollars. With 50% down, the balance financed over 12 months with NO interest.\r\n', '-87.636895', '18.898166    ', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 400.00, 'bed', ''),
(721, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'NTS-V', 791.00, 73.57, 0.00, 0, 'Av. Kukulkan ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '230', 1, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'Below Market Price: Beautiful 1-Bedroom Condo Spanning 2 Floors in Nook, Tulum Community.', 'Nook Tulum is a new boutique complex located in Region 8, designed as a luxurious resort that can be operated according to the owner\'s preference, whether for vacation rentals, long-term rentals, or as a place of residence.\r\n\r\nCovering 7,500 mÂ² of lush vegetation, Nook Tulum offers 78 units, ensuring a tranquil retreat surrounded by nature. Residents can indulge in a variety of amenities, including:\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Pool & Jacuzzi\r\nâ€¢ Bar & green areas\r\nâ€¢ Security\r\nâ€¢ Starlink internet in the coworking area\r\n\r\nThis bright and spacious 1-bedroom, 2-bathroom condo features panoramic windows, high ceilings, and two terraces spanning two floors. Designed with a contemporary minimalist aesthetic, the condo incorporates accents of concrete and exotic wood, seamlessly blending with the natural surroundings.\r\n\r\nProperty is currently rented and ready to generate income for you!', '-87.458349', '20.174463', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(728, 'active', '', 18, 20, 62, '', 1130.00, 105.00, 0.00, 0, 'Av. Coba ', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '208', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2022, 18, '', NULL, '$30,000 USD Off! Enjoy the Summer Offer â€“ Still Available This September.', 'Get to know this penthouse loft in one of the most notable projects in Tulumâ€”Xalet. The project stands out for its over 20 amenities, prime location, and well-designed spaces.\r\n\r\nThis 3-level penthouse, with a total of 105mÂ², is offered for sale fully furnished and equipped. It features high-end appliances, stylish interiors, and a private rooftop with a pool and beautiful views.\r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\nâ€¢ Access to a beach club\r\nâ€¢ Rooftop infinity pool, swim-up pool, and jacuzzi\r\nâ€¢ Yoga deck, zen garden, spa, and wellness center\r\nâ€¢ Gym, spinning room, reading lounge, and snack bar\r\nâ€¢ Rooftop lounge with fire pits\r\nâ€¢Concierge service, 24/7 security\r\n\r\nWith direct access to Av. CobÃ¡, you\'re close to restaurants, cafes, Chedraui Selecto, transportation, the beach, and downtown Tulum.\r\n\r\nContact us for more information!', '', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'loft', ''),
(722, 'active', '', 18, 3, 68, 'HVT-V', 8713.30, 809.50, 15424.60, 0, '', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '27', 8, 10, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2, '', NULL, 'Luxury Hacienda in Tulum: Experience the Magic of Moroccan-Mexican Design Surrounded By Jungle.', 'Luxury hacienda surrounded by the Mayan Jungle, featuring a fusion of Moroccan and Mexican design. This boutique hotel can be operated either as a private villa or room by room. \r\n\r\nMain features:\r\nâ€¢ 8 bedrooms, 10 1/2 bathrooms\r\nâ€¢ Garden\r\nâ€¢ Patio jacuzzi\r\nâ€¢ SPA & Relaxation Pavilion\r\nâ€¢ Covered Outdoor Dining Area\r\nâ€¢ Rooftop Pool\r\nâ€¢ Sun lounges & Bar\r\nâ€¢ Reception Area\r\nâ€¢ Parking \r\n\r\nLocated in La Veleta, one of the newest residential areas in town, on a private street with no nearby constructions. It\'s a quiet neighborhood just 5 minutes away from the city center and about 15 minutes from the beach.\r\n', '-87.474864', '20.193096', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1433.00, 'bed', ''),
(725, 'pending', '', 18, 20, 62, 'ATP3-V', 3121.50, 290.00, 0.00, 0, 'South 8th Street', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '204', 2, 2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 18, '', NULL, 'Exclusive Offer: Stunning 290mÂ² Penthouse in Holistika, $90K Below Market Value!', 'Priced to Sell! This penthouse boasting a total area of 290mÂ², offered at $90,000 USD below market price.\r\n\r\nLocated right next to Holistika Wellness Center, the complex consists of only 24 condos, ensuring privacy.\r\n\r\nInside, you\'ll find elegant design, high-quality finishes, and a private jacuzzi in the living area. The lock-off system in one of the bedrooms allows for flexibility in usage and the possibility to sublet the property.\r\n\r\nThe private rooftop terrace is truly a highlight of this penthouse, spanning over 145mÂ² and featuring a 4-meter pool, a BBQ area, and a half bathroom. Additionally, the property features a laundry room/stockroom.\r\n\r\nAmenities within the complex:\r\nâ€¢ Swimming pool\r\nâ€¢ Palapa\r\nâ€¢ Gym\r\nâ€¢ Workspace with air conditioning and fast internet (starlink), perfect for remote work or studying.\r\nâ€¢ Green areas\r\nâ€¢ Parking\r\n\r\nAn easy access to the Holistika community wellness center, which offers a range of health and wellness services.\r\n', '-87.48391620843002', '20.199218283884292', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', ''),
(726, 'active', '', 18, 20, 64, 'NIDOV1', 2131.00, 198.00, 2690.00, 0, 'Nido 101', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77765', '225', 3, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 13, '', NULL, 'First Home in Nido 101, Tulum, Now Available!', 'Introducing the first home for sale in Nido 101, Tulum, priced at $845,000 USD during pre-sales! This 3-bedroom property showcases a unique design and is perfectly situated to enjoy all that Tulum has to offer in one of its newest neighborhoods.\r\n\r\nNido 101 is one of the first projects located within Tulum 101. The luxury gated community features 85 single-family lots seamlessly interwoven with the captivating beauty of the jungle, located between Aldea Zama and the Tulum Hotel Zone.\r\n\r\nEnjoy first-class amenities, including a wellness pavilion, a pool/cenote, trails surrounded by lush vegetation, and more!\r\n\r\nFeaturing the latest technology, this home combines modern conveniences with thoughtful details that set it apart. Donâ€™t miss your chance to own this exceptional residence, a perfect blend of Mayan and classical architecture, in a highly desirable location.\r\n\r\nContact us for more information +52 984 32 22 505 (Kiin Realty)', '20.195898', '-87.449040', 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 250.00, 'bed', ''),
(727, 'active', '', 18, 20, 61, 'BC01-V', 1101.70, 102.36, 0.00, 48, 'Calle Labnah', '', '1811', '23', '65', '77760', '23', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 13, '', NULL, 'Swim-Up Condo for Sale in Brava Towers.   ', '1-bedroom condo for sale in the prestigious residential area of Aldea Zama within the exclusive development â€œBrava Towers.â€\r\n\r\nThis swim-up unit features direct access to the pool, a private jacuzzi, and a spacious private garden. Its corner position allows for plenty of natural light, thanks to windows on two sides, and provides better ventilation. Enjoy the atmosphere of privacy, as it is situated further away from neighbors.\r\n\r\nThe complex offers a great variety of amenities, including a beautiful garden-level pool, a rooftop infinity pool with a connecting bridge, a business center, a spa, a fitness center, a coworking space, an outdoor cinema, lobby bar, elevator access, free Wi-Fi, and parking. It also includes security measures, with controlled entry and 24-hour surveillance. \r\n\r\nThe condo is for sale unfurnished.\r\n', '-87.456031', '20.204009', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.00, 'bed', '');
